<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1Vankosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Kutumbula cha Vankosi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Van</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Van</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha Kutumbula cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vankosi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Hitabu ya 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi kadeni chavii chitabu chimonga chivaha. Chitabu chatumbwili kugavaniswa kuvya hitabu hivili pechatumbwili kutafusiliwa kuhamba mu luga ya Chigiliki, yeyakemiwa Septuagint. Yimanyikana lepi yani mweayandiki amala kuwunganisa hitabu ya 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi. Myandikaji wa chitabu cha Vankosi atumili mayandiku ndalindali kuwunganisa hitabu yeniyo (lola mifanu yilinga mu 1 Vankosi 11:41 na 14:19 na 14:29). Mewa yamanyakini lepi bwina ngati hitabu yeniyi yayandikwi amala yawunganiswa ndali. Yiwonekana bwina kuvya vamalili kuyandika lukumbi nkosi Yohakini peawusiwi kuhuma ku uvanda, mu mwaka miya muhanu na sitini na umonga kwakona Kilisitu angavelekwa, muni lijambu lenili likokwiswi mu 2 Vankosi 25:27. Mewa vayandikaji vamahele viholalela kuvya pandu pavaha pa hitabu yeniyi yiyandikwi miyaka yamahele yayipitili kwakona Yohakini angawusiwa ku uvanda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hitabu ya 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi hikokosa kuvala kila nkosi wa ku Isilaeli na ku Yuda. Nkosi zenizi zivili zatumbwili ngati unkosi umonga, nambu zagavaniki pala mwana wa Daudi mweakemiwi Solomoni peatalalili hitabu yeniyi hikokosa kuvala unkosi chewagavaniki na vikokosa mambu ga milima ihi hivili yeyilekini mbaka yoha hivili peyabuniwi na vandu vaki kupelekwa kumahamilu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Myandikaji amlongalili kila nkosi na usadika waki kwa Chapanga, ngati amlandili Chapanga amala amlandili lepi. “Vankosi vangi vahengili chila chevalagizwi na Bambu Chapanga.” 2 Vankosi 18:3. “Vangi vambudili Chapanga.” 2 Vankosi 21:12. Myandikaji akokwisi bwina utalalila wa vankosi vevahengili chila chechilagizwi na Bambu Chapanga na kulangisa kuvya gabwina goha gegahumalili mumilima yeniyo ndava ya usadikika wa vachilongosi vavi kwa Chapanga. Mu 2 Vankosi 17:7 yisomeka kuvya Vaisilaeli vapelikwi ku mahamilu muni, “Vaisilaeli vambudili Bambu Chapanga.” Na ndava muni, “Vayifugamili michapanga yingi.”</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavii mugati</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 1 mbaka ya 11 zikokosa Solomoni mwana wa Daudi cheabwelili kuvya nkosi na kuvala cheatalalili nkosi zivili za ku Yuda na ku Isilaeli pezavili unkosi umonga.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 12 mbaka ya 16 zikokosa kuvala kugavanika kwa ngomi zivili za ku Isilaeli na ku Yuda pamonga na vankosi vavi vangi va milima yeniyo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 17 mbaka ya 19 zikokosa kuvala uhengaji wa mlota Eliya na cheahengili ndava ya nkosi Ahabu wa ku Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 20 mbaka ya 22 zikokosa mwishu wa utalalila wa Ahabu pa Isilaeli pamonga na vankosi vangi va ku Isilaeli na ku Yuda.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Magono ga mwisu ga nkosi Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Lukumbi nkosi Daudi peavili mgogolo neju, vahengaji vaki vakamugubika mabulangeti muni apata lupyupyu, nambu pamonga na chenicho apatili lepi lupyupyu. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Ndi vahengaji vaki vakamujovela, “Bambu witu nkosi, mbanga tikulondelayi msikana wa kukuhengela na kukuyunga, agona pamonga na veve ndava upata lupyupyu.” <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Ndi vakalonda msikana mbwina pa Isilaeli poha. Vakamupata msikana mumonga mubwina kuhuma ku chijiji cha Shunami, mweikemiwa Abishagi, ndi vakamuleta kwa nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Msikana mwenuyo avii mbwina neju, ndi akatumbula kumuhengela na kumuyangalila nkosi, nambu nkosi agonikini nayu lepi.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adoniya igana unkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Lukumbi lwenulo Adoniya mwana wa Daudi na nyinawaki avii Hagiti, akatumbula kumeka kuvya mwene ndi mweivya nkosi. Ndi akajitendelekela mutuka za ngondo za kuhutwa na falasi, vakwela falasi na vandu hamusini vevakumulongolela. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Nambu Daudi, dadi waki amulakalili lepi hati mala yimonga. Chakaka Adoniya anyambili neju na avii mbena wa Abusalomu. <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adoniya akalongela na Yoabu mwana wa mau mweikemiwa Seluya, na mteta Abiasali ndava ya mpangu waki, na vene vakamuyidakila na vakavya naku chindu chimonga. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Nambu mteta Sadoki na Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, na mlota Natani na Shimei na Lei pamonga na valonda va Daudi, vayidakilini lepi na Adoniya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Ligono limonga Adoniya awusili teta ya mambelele na mifuya pamonga na mifuya yeyikulupalili pa Liganga la Zoheleti, papipi na chinyepa chechikemiwa Enilogeli. Akavagongolela valongo vaki voha vabwela pa teta yeniyo, yani vana vangi va nkosi, vandu va ngondo va likabila la Yuda na vahengaji voha va nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Nambu avagongolili lepi mlota Natani, Benaya na valonda va nkosi na Solomoni mulongo waki.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni ivikwa avya nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Penapo Natani akahamba kwa Batisheba nyinawaki Solomoni, akamukota, “Wu, upiliki lepi kuvya Adoniya, mwana wa mau mweikemiwa Hagiti, ajikili mwene kuvya nkosi na nkosi witu Daudi amanyili lepi? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Hinu ngati ugana kuusangula wumi waku na wa mwana waku Solomoni ndi nikujovela ukita naha, <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />uhamba kwa nkosi Daudi ukamukotayi, ‘Wu, wa bambu wangu nkosi, wanilapakisi lepi nene namvanda waku wajovii, “Mwana waku Solomoni yati italalila pahali pangu na yati itama panani ya chigoda changu cha utalalila?” Ndava kyani hinu Adoniya ndi nkosi?’ <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Na peuvya wakona ulongela na nkosi, nene yati niyingila na kuyongesa uchakaka mumalovi gaku.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Ndi Batisheba akahamba kwa nkosi kuchumba chaki, lukumbi lwenulo nkosi avii mgogolo neju, na Abishagi kuhuma ku Shunami avii akumuhengela. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Batisheba akagundama na kumfugamila nkosi, na mwene nkosi ndi akamukota, “Ugana kyani?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Batisheba akamuyangula, “Bambu wangu, wanilapalili nene namvanda waku kuni Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku iyuwana, ukajova, ‘Mwana wangu Solomoni yati italalila pahala pangu na yati itama panani ya chigoda changu cha unkosi.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Hinu lola, Adoniya italalila pamonga veve wa bambu wangu nkosi umanyili lepi kuvala genago. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Awusili teta zamahele za mambelele na mifuya pamonga na mifuya yeyikulupalili, na mwene avagongolili vana voha va nkosi na mteta Abiasali na Yoabu mkekesi wa manjolinjoli. Nambu amugongolili lepi Solomoni muhengaji waku. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Bambu wangu nkosi, Vaisilaeli voha vilindila uvajovelayi ndi yani mweitama panani ya chigoda chaku cha unkosi pala peuvya uvii lepi. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Ngati chenicho lepi, yati yivya, lukumbi veve wa bambu wangu nkosi peufwayi, nene pamonga na mwana wangu Solomoni yati tivalangiwa kuvya tihokili.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Lukumbi Batisheba peavii akona ilongela na nkosi, mlota Natani na mwene akahika pandu penapo. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Nkosi akajovewa kuvya, “Mlota Natani abwelili avii penapa.” Mlota Natani peahikili paavii nkosi ndi akamugundamila mbaka kupamisa ndima. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Natani akajova, “Bambu wangu, wu, wajovili lepi kuvya, ‘Adoniya yati ivya nkosi pahala pangu na kuvya yati itamila chigoda changu cha unkosi?’ <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Muni lelu ahelili kubwe kuwusa teta ya mambelele na mifuya pamonga na mifuya yeyikulupalili, na avakalibisi vana va nkosi na Yoabu na vachilongosi va manjolinjoli pamonga na mteta Abiatali. Venavo voha vilya na kunywa palongolo ya Adoniya kuni vijova, ‘Atama wumi wamahele nkosi Adoniya!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Nambu atigongolili lepi, nene muhengaji waku, hati mteta Sadoki, wala Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada na muhengaji waku Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Wu, veve ndi ugayidakili goha aga bambu wangu, nkosi, changali kuvajovela vahengaji vaku mundu mweitama panani ya chigoda chaku?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Na mwene nkosi Daudi akayangula, “Munikemelela Batisheba abwela mugati.” Batisheba akabwela na kuyingila akayima palongolo ya nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Ndi nkosi akalapa cha kujova, “Chakaka ngati Bambu Chapanga cheitama, mwene mweanisangwili mumang'aiso gamahele, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />ngati chenalapili kuni Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli iyuwana, chenajovili, ‘Mwana waku Solomoni yati italalila pahala pangu, na kuvya yati itama panani ya chigoda changu cha unkosi,’ Ndi chenikita lelu.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Penapo ndi Batisheba peagundimi mbaka pahi, akamgundamila nkosi, na kujova, “Bambu wangu nkosi Daudi na atamayi magono goha gangali na mwisu!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Na mwene nkosi Daudi akajova, “Munikemelelayi mteta Sadoki na mlota Natani pamonga na Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada.” Na vene vakabwela na kuyima palongolo ya nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />Na mwene nkosi akavajovela, “Muvatola vahengaji vangu, mukamukweha Solomoni mwana wangu panani ya lipunda falasi langu muhamba nayu mbaka ku chinyepa cha Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Penapo mteta Sadoki na mlota Natani vahamba vakamnyunyisila mahuta ga kumnyambisa avya nkosi wa Isilaeli, na vakamala kumnyala mahuta mubeta mapenenga na kujova, ‘Atama wumi wa magono gamahele nkosi Solomoni!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Na nyenye yati mukumulanda mumbele peibwela kutama panani ya chigoda changu cha unkosi na kutalalila pahala pangu, muni nene nimuhagwili avya mtalalila wa pa Isilaeli na pa Yuda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Penapo Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada akamuyangula nkosi, “Ena! Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa bambu wangu nkosi, na ajova chichocho. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Ngati Bambu Chapanga cheavili na bambu wangu nkosi, na avyayi chichocho na Solomoni, na kuutopesa unkosi waki muni uvya neju ya unkosi wa bambu wangu Daudi.”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Ndi, mteta Sadoki na mlota Natani na Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada na misambi ivili na valonda va nkosi Daudi kuhuma ku Keleti na ku Peleti, voha vakahelela vakamukweha Solomoni pa lipunda falasi la nkosi Daudi, na kumupeleka mbaka ku chinyepa cha Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Penapo mteta Sadoki akatola ling'elu la mahuta kuhuma mu Lindanda lalivikiwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga na kumunyisila mahuta Solomoni avya nkosi. Na vakabeta mapenenga, na vandu voha vakajova, “Atama wumi wa magono gamahele nkosi Solomoni!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Penapo vandu voha vakamulanda Solomoni, kuni vitova vitolilo, kuni vihekelela kwa sangaluka neju, mbaka mulima ukanyugusika ndava ya lwami zavi.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Ndi Adoniya pamonga na vayehe vevavii pamonga naku, vakayuwana lwami zenizo pevamali kulya mselebuko. Na mwene Yoabu peayuwini lwami lwa mapenenga ndi akajova, “Makelele gena ga kyani kubomani uko?” <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Lukumbi peajovayi, akayingila Yonatani mwana wa mteta Abiatali, ndi Adoniya akajova, “Yingila mugati, muni veve wamundu wabwina pangi uleta ukokoso wabwina.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Yonatani akamuyangula Adoniya, “Pehe, muni bambu witu nkosi Daudi amukitili Solomoni avya nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Na mwene nkosi amupeliki pamonga na mteta Sadoki na mlota Natani na Benaya mwana waki Yehoyada pamonga na valonda va nkosi va kuhuma ku Keleti na ku Peleti, na vene kuni vamukwesili panani ya lipunda falasi la nkosi, <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />kangi mteta Sadoki na mlota Natani vamnyunyisili mahuta ku chinyepa cha Gihoni muni avya nkosi, na vawukili penapo kuni vihekelela, genago ndi makelele geukugayuwana. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Ndi Solomoni itama panani ya chigoda cha unkosi. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Pamonga na ago vahengaji va nkosi vabwelili kumulumba bambu witu nkosi Daudi vakajova, ‘Chapanga waku alikitayi liina la Solomoni livya likulu neju kuliku laku, mewa achitopesayi neju chigoda chaki cha unkosi kuliku chaku.’ Penapo nkosi akagundamila pa chitanda chaki, <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />na kuyupa cha kujova, ‘Alumbiwayi Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli, mweamukitili mvelekanu wangu avya nkosi pahala pangu, na mweanipelili wumi mbaka nigaweni aga!’”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Penapo ndi vayehe voha vevavii pamonga na Adoniya vakayogopa neju ndava ya kukenyemuswa na ujumbi wenuwo, vakawuka cha kupechangana kila mundu akahamba kwaki. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Na mwene Adoniya ndava ya kumuyogopa Solomoni ndi akatilalila mu Lindanda lalivikiwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga akakamula mang'elu ga pandu pa kuwusila teta muni akotoka kukomiwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Nkosi Solomoni akayuwana kuvya Adoniya atilalili mulindanda, na kuvya akamulili mang'elu ga pandu pa kuwusila teta kuni ijova, “Yati niwuka lepi penapa mbaka nkosi Solomoni peakunijovelayi kuvya yati ilagisa lepi nene mtumisi waki nikomiwayi.”<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Nkosi Solomoni akajova, “Ngati akawonekanayi kuvya msadikika yati ikitiwa lepi lihakahu hati limonga. Nambu nikamuwonayi kuvya muhakahu ndi yati ikomiwa.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Penapo nkosi Solomoni akalagisa vamukemela Adoniya kuhuma mulindanda na abwela kwaki. Adoniya akabwela palongolo ya nkosi, akagundama cha utopesa. Nkosi akamujovela, “Hamba kunyumba yaku.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi ampela Solomoni malagizu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Daudi peavii papipi kufwa, akamkemela Solomoni mwana waki na kumuluwulila malovi ga mwisu, akamulagiza Solomoni mwana waki, <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />akajova, “Mwana wangu nene nivi papipi kufwa ngati cheyivili kwa vindu vyoha vyevi mumi. Uvya ngangali na mkekesi. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Kamulayi lila leakulagisi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku. Ukitayi geigana, ukamulayi malagizu na amuli zaki na mihilu yaki na cheikita, ngati cheyiyandikwi mu malagizu ga Musa, muni umotiswa mu goha geuhenga na popoha pewihamba. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Ngati ukamyidakila Bambu Chapanga, na mwene yati itimilisa lilaganu laki leavikili pamonga na nene pala peanijovili kuvya, yikavyayi viveleku vyangu yati viyidakila malagizu gaki na kumuhengela kwa usadikika na kwa mitima yavi yoha, pagati yavi yati ikosekana lepi mundu wa kutalalila pa Isilaeli lukumbi lwoha.”<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />“Pamonga na genago, umanya mewa gala geanihengili Yoabu, mwana wa Seluya, cheavahengili vakekesi va ngondo vavili va manjolinjoli ga Isilaeli, Abuneli mwana wa Neli na Amasa mwana wa Yeteli. Avakomili lukumbi lwa uteke kuvya ngati lukumbi lwa ngondo. Avakomili vandu vevangahoka, hinu yati ilipa ndava ya geahengili na yikumgana abuniwayi. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Hinu, ukitayi kulandana na luhala lwaku, nambu ndu ukotokayi kumuleka afwayi cha uteke.”<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />“Nambu uvahengelayi gabwina vana va Baluzilai va ku Gileadi, na uvayunga bwina vavyayi pagati ya vala vevilya pamonga na veve, muni vanihengili gabwina lukumbi penamutilayi mulongo waku Abusalomu. <verse eid="1KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />Mewa avii Shimei mwana wa Gela, mundu wa likabila la Benjamini kuhuma ku Bahulimu, mwenuyo anilapakisi na kunipela likoto neju penahambili ku Mahanaaimu, nambu peabwelili kunipokela ku mfuleni Yoludani, namulapakisi kuni Bambu Chapanga iyuwana na kumujovela, ‘Yati nikukukoma lepi kwa upanga.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Nambu veve ukoto kumuleka changali kumupela mbunu. Veve uvi na luhala, yati umanya chakumuhengela pamonga kuvya mwene ndi mgogolo na ana huliya, kotoka kumuleka, mukomayi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufwa kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Daudi afwili na kuzikiwa pamuji wa Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Afwili peamali kutalalila pa Isilaeli mulukumbi lwa miyaka alubaini, miyaka saba avili ku Hebuloni, na miyaka selasini na hidatu avili ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Penapo Solomoni akatama pachigoda cha unkosi pahali pa Daudi, dadi waki, na unkosi waki ukavya ngangali.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Adoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Mwanakandahi, Adoniya mwana wa mau mweikemiwa Hagiti, akahamba kwa Batisheba, nyina waki Solomoni. Batisheba akamukota, “Wu, ubwela cha uteke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Adoniya akamyangula, “Ena, nibwela cha uteke. <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Nambu nivii na lijambu limonga ndu la kukujovela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Batisheba akamujovela, “Jova ndu.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Na mwene Akayangula, “Veve umanyili kuvya unkosi waganikiwayi uvya wa nene, na Vaisilaeli voha vahuvalilayi nene nivya nkosi. Nambu mambu gakang'anamuka na Bambu Chapanga amupelili mlongo wangu unkosi. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Hinu nivii na lijambu limonga lenikukuyupa na ukotoka kunibelalela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Batisheba akajova, “Jova ndu.”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Na mwene Adoniya akajova, “Chondi, nikukuyupa umuyupa nkosi Solomoni anileka nimtola Abishagi, mdala wa ku Shunami avya mdala wangu, muni nimanyili kuvya veve yati akukubelelela lepi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Batisheba akamuyangula, “Ena yati nilongela na nkosi ndava yaku.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Ndi Batisheba akahamba kwa nkosi Solomoni kumukokosela cheiyupa Adoniya. Nkosi akayima akahamba kumujambusa nyina waki, akamugundamila kulangisa utopesa. Na akatama kangi pachigoda chaki cha unkosi, akalagisa vamuletela chigoda nyina waki, na mwene akatama upandi wa kulyelela wa nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Batisheba akajova nkosi, “Nivii na lijambu chidogo la kukuyupa, niyupa uniyuwanilayi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Nkosi akayangula, “Yupa nyina wangu yati nikukubelalela lepi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Nyina waki akajova, “Umuyidakila mulongo waku Adoniya amugega Abishagi mdala wa ku Shunami avya mdala waki.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Nkosi Solomoni akamkota nyina waki, “Ndava kyani ugana nimupelayi Adoniya amgega Abishagi wa ku Shunami? Chenichi chiwanangana na kumuyupila unkosi wangu! Kumbukayi kuvya mwene ndi muhaja wangu muvaha, na mewa mteta Abiatali na Yoabu mkekesi wa ngodo mwana waki Seluya vavii upandi waki!” <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Penapo nkosi Solomoni akalapa kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga, na kujova, “Chapanga wangu na anikoma ndu yikavyayi Adoniya yati ifwa lepi ndava ya chenichi cheachiyupili! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Hinu, kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi, mweanivikili na kunikangamalisa mu unkosi wa dadi wangu Daudi. Na mweatimalisi cheajovili, akanipela unkosi nene pamonga na viveleku vyangu. Chakaka nilapa kuvya lelu Adoniya yati ikomiwa!”<verse eid="1KI 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Penapo nkosi Solomoni akawusa malagizu kwa Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada kumukoma Adoniya na Benaya akakita chenicho.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abiatali ivingiwa na Yoabu ikomiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Pa genago, nkosi Solomoni akamjovela mteta Abiatali, “Wuka uhamba kumgunda waku ku Anatoti, veve uganikiwa kukomiwa! nambu hinu, yati nikukukoma lepi ndava muni walihengili Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga palongolo ya dadi wangu Daudi na wapatili mang'aisu goha pamonga nayu.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Ndi nkosi Solomoni akamuvinga Abiasali, akotoka kuvya mteta wa Bambu Chapanga, chenicho ndi likahengeka linenu leajovili Bambu Chapanga ku Shilo, ndava ya mteta Eli na lukolo lwaki.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Yoabu peagayuwini genago, akajumbalila Mulindanda lelivaguliwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga na kukamulila mang'elu ga pandu pakuwusila luteta muni akotoka kukomiwa, muni awungini lepi na Abusalomu nambu awungini na Adoniya. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Nkosi Solomoni peayuwini kuvya Yoabu avii mu lindanda lelivaguliwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga na kuvya ayimili pamuhana ya pandu pa kuwusila teta, ndi Solomoni akamutuma Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, na kumujovela, “Hamba kamkoma Yoabu.” <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Penapo, Benaya akahamba mulindanda lelivaguliwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga, na kumujovela Yoabu, “Nkosi alagisi uhuma kuvala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Yoabu akayangula, “Nene nihuma lepi yati nifwa bahapa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Benaya akakiliwuka kwa nkosi na kumukokosela cheayangwi Yoabu.<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Solomoni akajova, “Kita ngati cheajovili Yoabu, umukoma na kumuzika. Penapo nene na viveleku vingi vyoha vya Daudi yati tivya tihokili lepi ndava ya mambu geahengili Yoabu ga kuvakoma vandu vevangabuda. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Bambu Chapanga yati akumubuna Yoabu ndava ya cheavakomili changali kumanya dadi wangu. Mwene avakomili vandu vavili vevahuvaliwi neju kuliku mwene, mewa vavili vabwina neju ya mwene, amukomili Abuneli mwana wa Neli, mkekesi wa ngondo wa manjolinjoli ga Vaisilaeli, na Amasa mwana wa Yetili, mkekesi wa ngondo wa manjolinjoli ga Vayuda. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Mbunu wa kukomiwa wenuwo ndi yati uvya kwa Yoabu pamonga na viveleku vyaki magono goha gangali mwisu. Nambu magono goha Bambu yati akuvamotisa Daudi na viveleku vyaki vevitamila chigoda cha unkosi, Chapanga yati akumumotisa Daudi na uveleku waki na vandu va munyumba yaki na unkosi yati vivya na uteke magono goha gangali na mwisu.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Ndi Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, akahamba mulindanda lelivaguliwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga, akamukoma Yoabu na kumuzika mumugunda wa mwene Yoabu kulugangatu. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Nkosi akamuvika Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, avya chilongosi wa vandu va ngondo pahala pa Yoabu, na Sadoki avya mteta pahala pa Abiatali.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Shimei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Mewa nkosi akalagisa akemiwa Shimei, na akamujovela, “Jijengelayi nyumba yaki bahapa pa Yelusalemu, utamayi penapa changali kuhamba pandu pangi popoha. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Muni ligono leuwuka na kuyomboka kapela ka Kidiloni, nikukujovela chakaka yati ufwa, na yati ukujivembenekela wamwene kwa kufwa kwaku.”<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Shimei akayangula, “Chabwina nkosi. Yati nikita ngati cheujovili.” Ndi akatama pa Yelusalemu lukumbi lutali.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Nambu pa mwishu wa mwaka wa datu, vavanda vavili va Shimei vakatoloka, vakahamba kwa Akishi mwana wa Maaka, nkosi wa ku Gati. Shimei peayuwini kuvya vavanda vaki vavii ku Gati, <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />akakwela lipunda laki, akahamba kwenuko kuvalonda, kwa nkosi Akishi. Ndi akahika na akavakolela ndi akavawuyisa kunyumba. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Nkosi Solomoni peayuwini kuvya Shimei awukili pa Yelusalemu, kuhamba ku Gati na kuwuya, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />akamukemela Shimei na kumujovela, “Wu, wanilapalili lepi kwa liina la Bambu kuvya yati uwuka lepi pa Yelusalemu, na nene si nakulakalili njwee kuvya, chakaka yati ufwa ngati ukalinga kuhamba kuvala ya muji? Na veve wayidakili, wanijovili, ‘Chabwina, Yati nikita ngati cheujovili.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Hinu mbona udenyili chilapu chaku kwa Bambu Chapanga na kugaleka malagizu genakupelili?” <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Nkosi akayendelela kumujovela Shimei, “Ugamanyili njwee gahakahu gewamuhengili dadi wangu Daudi. Na hinu ndava ya genago, Bambu Chapanga yati akukubuna, <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />nambu nene yati akunimotisa, mewa Bambu Chapanga yati akuukangamalisa unkosi wa Daudi magono goha gangali na mwisu.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Penapo nkosi akamulagisa Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, na mwene akahamba kumubuna na kumukoma Shimei. Ndava yeniyo unkosi wa Solomoni ukakangamaliswa.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni iyupa luhala kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 1:3-12">2 Lus 1:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Salomoni akamgega msikana wa nkosi wa ku Misili na hinu vakayidakilana. Akamuleta msikana wa nkosi wa ku Misili pamuji weukemiwa muji wa Daudi, mbaka peamalili kujenga Nyumba yaki mwene na nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga na luwumba lwa kuutindila muji wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Kwakona gangakitika genago, lukumbi lwenulo vandu vawusayi teta kuhitumbi, ndava muni Nyumba ya Chapanga yavii yakona yangajengwa. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Solomoni amuganili Bambu Chapanga, na akagalanda gealagiswi na Daudi, dadi waki, nambu ndu na mwene aganikiwi kuwusa teta za hinyama ya kutinyiswa na kuhukisa ubani ku hitumbi.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Lukumbi nunuyu, nkosi Solomoni ahambili kuwusa teta ku Gibeoni, muni pavili ndi pandu papimanyikana pa kuyupila. Chenicho ndi cheayovalili kukita Solomoni kuwusa maelufu ga teta za kutinyiswa mu pandu penapo pa kuwusila teta. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Peavili kwenuko ku Gibeoni, kilu Bambu Chapanga amuhumalili mundoto, na akamujovela, “Yupa chochoha chewigana na nene yati nikukupela.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Solomoni akayangula, “Wamulangisi ubwina wamahele neju dadi wangu Daudi, muni akuhengili kwa usadika na kwa ubwina na kukita mambu gegakukuganisa veve, na uyendalili kumulangisa uganu waku kwa kumukita mwana waki atama pa chigoda chaki cha unkosi. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, univikili nene nivya nkosi pahali pa dadi wangu Daudi, pamonga kuvya nakona namsongolo nangavya na luhala lwa kulongosa. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Na peapa univikili pagati ya vandu vaku veuvahagwili, na vene ndi vamahele hati nakuhotola kuvalangika. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Hinu nikuyupa unipelayi nene namuhengaji waku luhala lwa kuvalongosa vandu vaku bwina, na nihotolayi kumanya gabwina na gahakahu, muni ndi yani mweihotola kuvalongosa vandu vaku vevavili vamahele naha?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Lijambu lenili leayupili Solomoni ndi lamganisi neju Bambu Chapanga, <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />na mwene ndi akamujovela, “Muni uyupili luhala lwa kuvalongosa vandu, na wajiyupili lepi wumi utali amala kuvya na vindu vyamahele, na wayupili lepi vamakoko vaku vakomiwayi, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />ndi hinu nikukukitila ngati cheuyupili. Lola nikukupela umanya na luhala, na kawaka mundu yoyoha mweavi navyu kwakona veve wangavya, na yati kuvya lepi mundu yungi mweihumalila pahala paku mweivye navyu. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Mewa yati nikukupela gala gewangagayupa, yati nikukupela vindu vyamahele pamonga na utopesa neju kuliku nkosi yungi yoyoha yula. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Kangi ngati ukaniyidakila na kulanda mihilu na malagizu gangu na kukita genilagisi ngati cheakitili dadi waku Daudi, hinu yati nikukita wumi wa magono gamahele.”<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Solomoni peayimwiki, akamanya kuvya ikavii ndoto. Ndi akakiliwuka ku Yelusalemu akayima palongolo ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, ndi akawusa teta za kutinyiswa na za uteke. Mewa akavakitila mselebuko vandu vaki voha.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni ihamula muhalu weunonopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Ligono limonga vadala vavili vakemi, vakahamba kwa nkosi Solomoni na kuyima palongolo yaki. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Mmonga wavi ndi akajova, “Veve bambu wangu, nene na muyangu uyu titama nyumba yimonga, nene naveliki mwana mgosi kuni mulumbu uyu avii munyumba mumumu. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Ligono la datu na mwene akaveleka mwana mgosi. Kwavili lepi na mundu yungi munyumba nambu tete tavavili ndu. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Lukumbi lwa kilu yimonga, mwana waki afwili ndava amugonalili. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Ndi akayimuka kilu neju, akamutola mwana wangu lukumbi nene nivii lugono, akamugoneka panganga yaki. Mewa akatola higa ya mwana waki mweafwili, akayigoneka panganga yangu. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Penayimwiki lukela na kugana kumunyongesa mwana wangu ndi nikakolela mwana afwili! Nambu penamulolokisi bwina, ndi nikamanya kuvya avili lepi mwana wangu mwenimuveliki.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Nambu mdala yungi yula ndi akajova, “Pehe! wangu ndi mweavii mumi nambu mweafwili ndi waku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Nambu yula wakutumbula ndi akayendelela kujova, “Pehe, mwana mweafwili ndi waku na mweavii mumi ndi wa nene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Chenichi ndi chevaywangisini palongolo ya nkosi.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Penapo ndi nkosi Solomoni akajova, “Mwavoha mwijova mweavii mumi ndi wangu na mweafwili wa nene lepi.” <verse eid="1KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Hinu, nkosi akalagisa, “Muniletelayi upanga!” Vakamuletela. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Nkosi akajova, “Mudumulayi mwana mweavii mumi vipandi vivili na umupelayi kila mmonga chipandi chimonga.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Mdala mweavii nyina wa mwana mweavili mumi akavya na lipyanda ndava ya mwana waki, akamujovela nkosi, “Chondi nkosi, mukotoka kumukoma mwana. Mumupela muyangu mwana mweavii mumi, amutola mwene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Nambu mudala yungi yula ndi akajova, “Pehe! Mwana akotoka kuvya wa nene amala waki. Mudumulayi hipandi hivili.”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Nkosi Solomoni akajova, “Kotoka kumukoma mwana! Mupela mdala mwaigana mwana avya mumi amutolayi, muni mwene ndi nyina waki.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Vandu voha va Isilaeli pevayuwini uhamula weauwusili nkosi, ndi vakamuyogopa, vakamanya kuvya avii na luhala lwa Chapanga lwelumuhotwisi kuhamula muhalu cheyiganikiwa.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Vachilongosi vevavii pahi ya ulongosi wa nkosi Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Solomoni avii nkosi wa mulima woha wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Vatumisi vakulu vangi vevamutangatilayi muutalalila waki ndi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:2">Azalia mwana wa Sadoki mwenu avii mteta.<verse eid="1KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Eliholefu na Ahiya vana va Shausha venavo vavili vayandikaji,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:3">Yehoshafati mwana wa Ahiludi mwenuyu avili wa kuvika ukumbuso.<verse eid="1KI 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaya mwana waki Yehoyada, avili mkulu wa msambi wa manjolinjoli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:4">Sadoki na Abiatali venavo vavili vamteta.<verse eid="1KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Azalia mwana wa Natani, avili chilongosi mkulu wa vahengaji voha,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:5">Mteta Zabudi mwana wa Natani avili mundu wa papipi wa kulongela na nkosi.<verse eid="1KI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahishali avili mkulu wa munyumba ya chinkosi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:6">Adonilamu mwana wa Abuda, avili myimamila wa mahengu ga kulazimisa.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Mewa Solomoni ahagwili vakulu vatalalila kumi na vavili va mulima woha wa Isilaeli. Venavo vapewili lihengu la kulonda chakulya ndava ya nkosi pamonga na nyumba yaki kila mumonga aletili chakulya kuhuma kweatalalilayi mu mwehi umonga mu kila mwaka. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Maina gavi ndi aga,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1KI 4:8">Benihuli atalalilayi pandu pa hitumbi ya Efulaimu,<verse eid="1KI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Benidekeli atalalili miji ya Makai, Shaalibimu na Beti Shemeshi pamonga na Eloni Beti Hanani.<verse eid="1KI 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Benihesedi ayimamili muji wa Aluboti, mewa ayimamili muji wa Soko na pandu pa mulima wa Hefeli.<verse eid="1KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Beniabinadabu, mngana wa Tafati msikana wa Solomoni, ayimamili upandi woha wa Nafati Doli.<verse eid="1KI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Baana mwana wa Ahiludi, ayimamili miji ya Taanaki na Megido na pandu poha pa muji wa Beti Sheani weuvii papipi na muji wa Zaletani, kusini mwa muji wa Yezileeli, na kuhuma ku Beti Sheani mbaka ku miji ya Abeli Mehola, na hati kupita muji wa Yokimeamu.<verse eid="1KI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Benigebeli, ayimamili muji wa Lamoti Gileadi pamonga na hijiji ya Gileadi vyevyavi vya Yaili, wa chiveleku cha Manase, mewa ayimamili mukoa wa Aligobu weuvili ku Bashani wewavi na miji sitini yeyatindisiwi luhumba na kuvikwa vidindilu vya shaba mumamilyangu.<verse eid="1KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadabu, mwana wa Ido, ayimamili muji wa Mahanahimu.<verse eid="1KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaasi, mngana wa Basemati msikana wa Solomoni, ayimamila pandu pa likabila la Nafutali.<verse eid="1KI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana mwana wa Hushai, ayimamili pandu pa likabila la Asheli na muji wa Bealoti.<verse eid="1KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yehoshafati mwana wa Palua, ayimamili pandu pa likabila la Isakali.<verse eid="1KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Shimei mwana wa Ela, ayimamili pandu pa likabila la Benjamini.<verse eid="1KI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Gebeli mwana wa Uli, ayimamili muji wa Gileadi, pakutumbula muji wenuwu watalaliwi na nkosi Sihoni wa Vaamoli, na nkosi Ogu wa ku Bashani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 4:19">Pamonga na kuvya na vakulu voha ava kumi na vavili, kwavili na mkulu mmonga mweayimamili mulima woha.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utalalila wa nkosi Solomoni uyongeseka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Vandu va pa Yuda na va pa Isilaeli vavili vamahele ngati msavati wa kumbwani, vene valyayi na kunywega na kusangaluka. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Solomoni atalalili nkosi zoha kutumbula mfuleni Efulati mbaka ku mulima wa Vafilisiti, mbaka kumibaka ya ku Misili. Vandu va milima yeniyo yoha vamuhengili na kulipa kodi kwaki lukumbi lwoha lwa wumi waki.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Chakulya chevalyayi munyumba ya Solomoni kwa ligono limonga, ndi chavili uhembe wa nyilinyili madebe miya hidatu na sitini, na uhembe wangayagika bwina madebe miya saba na ishilini, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />ng'ombi zezikulupalili kumi za muchivaya, na ng'ombi za kudimwa ishilini, mambelele miya yimonga pamonga na ngolombo na mbavala na nguku zazikulupalili.<verse eid="1KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Solomoni atalalili mulima woha wa ku upandi welitipama lilanga ya mfuleni Eufulati, kuhumila ku Tifuna mbaka ku muji wa Gaza na atamili cha uteke na vandu va milima yoha yeyimtindila. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Lukumbi lwa wumi wa Solomoni mlima wa Yuda na Isilaeli kutumbula ku Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba, vatamili kwa uteke kila mmonga pahi ya mikongo yaki ya mizabibu na ya mitini.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Solomoni avili na mandanda elufu alubaini ndava ya kuvika mutuka zaki za ngondo za kuhutwa na falasi, na manjolinjoli vakwela falasi elufu kumi na vavili. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Vachilongosi kumi na vavili veavahagwili vala kila mmonga akapeleka chakulya kwa nkosi Solomoni, kulandana na mwehi weapangiwi kupeleka ndava ya nkosi pamonga na vandu vevavii munyumba ya nkosi. Solomoni na vandu va munyumba yaki vapatili vindu vyoha vyevaganili. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Kila mmonga peyahikili zamu yaki, ndi aletili mewa shayili na manyahi ga kulisila falasi mewa valetili na falasi zezihuta mutuka za ngondo, vindu vyenivyo vyoha vavipeliki pandu pepiganikiwa.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Chapanga amupelili Solomoni umanya na luhala lwamahele, umanya waki wavii lepi na chipimu ngati msavati wa kumbwani. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Luhala lwa Solomoni lwavili luvaha neju ya vandu voha vevana luhala va kwelihumila lilanga na lwavahotwili vandu voha va ku Misili. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Solomoni avahotwili vandu voha kwa luhala, avahotwili Etani, yula mundu wa ku Ezilahi, Hemani na Kalikoli na Dalida vana va Maholi. Na kulumbiwa kwaki kwadandasiki mumilima yoha ya papipi. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Solomoni azijovili misali elufu zidatu na kuyimba nyimbu neju ya elufu yimonga. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Alongalili mambu ga hikongo yoha kutumbula muelezi weuvili ku Lebanoni, na husopo weumela na kulandala muluhuka. Mewa alongalili kuvala hinyama na hidege na viumbi vyevikwava vyevitagila makang'a, na kuvala somba. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Vandu kuhuma kumilima yoha, na vankosi voha vevayuwini mambu ga kuvala luhala lwa Solomoni, vabwelili kumuyuwanila.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni akujitendekeha kujenga nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2 Lus 2:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Hilamu nkosi wa ku Tilo, mweavili mkozi wa Daudi, peayuwini kuvya Solomoni anyaliwi mahuta avya nkosi pahali pa dadi waki, akavatuma vahengaji vaki vahamba kwa Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Penapo Solomoni akamuyangula Hilamu kwa kumpelekela ujumbi wenuwu. <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Umanyili kuvya Dadi wangu Daudi ahotwili lepi kumujengela Bambu, Chapanga waki nyumba ya kumfugamila, ndava ya kuvya na ngondo zamahele na vamakoko vaki va milima ya papipi mbaka pala Bambu Chapanga peampelili uhotola. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Nambu hinu, Bambu Chapanga wangu, anipelili uteke pandi zoha nivi lepi na makoko wala wogohi wa kuzangiwa. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Ndi niamwili kumujengela Bambu Chapanga wangu nyumba ya kumfugamila. Chenichi ndi chila Bambu Chapanga cheamulagazili Daudi dadi wangu na kumujovela, ‘Mwana waku mwenikumuvika pa chigoda chaku cha unkosi, ndi mweakunijengela nyumba ya kunifugamila.’ <verse eid="1KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Hinu uvalagasila vandu vaku vanidumulila mikongo ya mielezi ya ku Lebanoni. Na vandu vangu yati vakujiwunga na vandu vaku mulihengu lenilo, na nene yati nikuvapela luhuna vandu vaku ngati cheujova, muni ngati cheumanyili, kawaka mundu mweihotola kudumula hikongo ngati nyenye mwa Vasidoni.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Hilamu ahekalili neju peayuwini ujumbi wenuwu kuhuma kwa Solomoni, ndi akajova, “Lelu alumbiwa Bambu Chapanga, kwa kumpela Daudi mwana mweavii na luhala atalalilayi vandu ava vamahele.” <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Hilamu akampelekela kangi ujumbi Solomoni, kumujovela, “Nipokili ujumbi waku, na nene yati nikita cheugana kuzivala mbao za mielezi na za mibeloshi. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Vandu vangu yati vigegelela magogo pamonga na kugahelesa kuhuma ku Lebanoni mbaka kunyanja na kugakunga malundu malundu gayevela mumanji mbaka pandu peukunijovelayi. Kwenuko yati giwopolewa na veve yati ukugapokela, mewa veve yati uganikiwa kuvapela chakulya vandu vangu.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Penapo, Hilamu akamupela Solomoni mbao zoha za hikongo ya mielezi na ya mibeloshi zeaganili, <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />na mwene Solomoni akampela Hilamu nganu madebe laki hivili na elufu alubaini, na mahuta gabwina madebe miya zivili mukila mwaka ndava ya vandu vaki.<verse eid="1KI 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akampela Solomoni luhala ngati cheamujovili. Pakavya na uteke pagati ya Solomoni na Hilamu, vakavika mapatanu pagati yavi.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Nkosi Solomoni akavavika pamonga vagosi elufu selasini kuhuma pandi zoha za pa Isilaeli, vahenga mahengu ga kulazimiswa. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Vandu venavo akavavagula misambi hidatu ya vandu elufu kumikumi, akahipeleka misambi yeniyo kwa lukumbi ndalindali, mwehi umonga ku Lebanoni na miehi hivili visigalila kumahengu ga kunyumba, na chilongosiwavi ndi avii Adolamu <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Mewa Solomoni avili na vandu elufu semanini va kubayulana maganga, na vandu elufu sabini va kugega maganga genago, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />na vandu vangi elufu hidatu na miya hidatu vevayimamili lihengu lenilo pamonga na vahengaji voha. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Ndava ya malagizu ga nkosi, vagimulini maganga gavahagavaha gegavii gabwina, muni gahongolewayi ndava ya kujengela mkingisu wa nyumba. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Chenicho ndi vajengaji va Solomoni na Hilamu pamonga na vandu va muji wa Gebali chevatendekihi mbawu pamonga na maganga ga kujengela nyumba ya kumfugamila Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni ijenga nyumba ya kumfugamila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Solomoni atumbwili kujenga nyumba ya kumfugamila Chapanga mumwaka wa miya mcheche na semanini, lukumbi Vaisilaeli pevavii vamali kuwuka ku Misili. Wenuwo ndi wavili mwaka wa mcheche tangia Solomoni peatumbwili kutalalila pa Isilaeli, mumwehi wa pili, wevikemela mwehi wa Zifu. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Nyumba yeniyo yeajengili nkosi Solomoni ndava ya Bambu ndi yavili na utali wa mita isilini na saba na upana wa mita tisa na kuhamba kunani mita kumi na hidatu na yapinga. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Sebuli ya palongolo ya nyumba yavili na upana wa mita mcheche na yapinga, kuhumila upandi umonga wa nyumba mbaka upandi wungi na utali waki wavii na mita tisa. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Nyumba yeniyo ayivikili madilisha gegatanwiki mugati nambu kuvala ngalingasi. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Solomoni ajengili vyumba vyevina dali zidatu vyeviwunganiswi na luwumba lwa nyumba ya kumfugamila Chapanga, kutumbula pelutumbukini luwumba mbaka pamwisu wa luwumba lwa nyumba ya kumfugamila Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Chumba cha pahi chavili na upana wa mita hivili na lobo na chumba cha pagati chavili na upana wa mita zivili na lobo hidatu na chumba cha datu chavili na upana wa mita zidatu. Vyumba vya golofa vyalekangini upana, ndava Solomoni apungwizi chipimu cha luwumba lwa kuvala kutindila nyumba, muni luwumba lwa pahi luchitangatila chumba cha panani yaki changali kutegemela mapanda ga kukamulila nyumba yeniyo.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Lukumbi peyajengwayi nyumba, lwayuwaniki lepi lwami lwa nyundu na livagu, wala lwa chindu chochoha cha lyuma, muni yajengiwi kwa maganga gegahongoliwi na kutendekewa njwee tangia kula kwevagagimili.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Mulyangu wa kuyingilila pandu pa pahi mulijengu lelayongiswi muluvava lwa nyumba, wavili upandi wa kusini. Mugati yaki mwavili na ngazi ya kukwelela ku chumba cha pagati na cha mwisu kunani. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Penapo, Solomoni akamala kuyijenga nyumba ya kumfugamila Chapanga na yikavya bwina. Dali ya nyumba ayijengili kwa boliti za mielezi na panani yaki atandiki mbagalu za mikongo yeikemiwa mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Vyumba vila vyeajengili vya golofa vyavili na utali wa kuhamba kunani mita hivili na lobo, vyenivyo vyawunganiswi na nyumba ya Chapanga kwa mbagalu za mielezi.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Lukumbi lwenulo linenu la Bambu Chapanga likamubwelela Solomoni kujova, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Ngati ukakita malagizu gangu na kulanda mihilu yangu, yati nikukukitila mambu goha genamuhaidili Daudi dadi waku. Kuyivala nyumba iyi yeukunijengela, <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />nene yati nitama pagati ya vandu vangu Vaisilaeli, na yati nikuvaleka lepi.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Penapo Solomoni ndi akamalakisa kuyijenga nyumba yeniyo ya kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vindu vya mugati ya munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:8-14">2 Lus 3:8-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Upandi wa mugati wa luwumba lwa nyumba agubiki kwa mbao za mielezi, kuhumila paluhumba mbaka ku mbagalu za dali na pahi alugubiki kwa mbao za mibeloshi. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Na chumba cha mugati chechakemiwi Pandu Pa Musopi neju, chajengiwi ku upandi wa kuyetu ya nyumba ya Chapanga. Chajengiwi kwa mbao za mielezi kuhumila pahi mbaka ku dali, na utali waki wavii mita tisa. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Chumba chechavili palongolo ya Pandu Pamusopi neju, ndi chavii na utali wa mita kumi na nane. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Mbao za mielezi zezagubikwi muluwumba lwa chumba cha mugati, zacholwi ngati lidenge na maluva gegahomwili. Kawaka liganga lelawonikini muni kila pandu pagubikwi kwa mbao za mielezi.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Mu chumba chamusopi neju, Solomoni avikili Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Chumba chenicho chavii na utali wa mita tisa na upana wa mita tisa na kunyoleka kwa mita tisa na chene vakilimi kwa zahabu yabwina. Mewa atengenizi pandu pa kuwusila teta kwa mbawu za mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Upandi wa mugati wa nyumba yeniyo Solomoni akilimi kwa zahabu yabwina, na kulongolo ya chumba chenicho cha mugati akavika minyololo yeabakili zahabu kuhuma upandi umonga mbaka upandi wungi. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Nyumba yoha cha mugati ayikilimi kwa zahabu, pamonga na pandu pa kuwusila teta pepavii muchumba cha pandu pamusopi neju.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Atenganizi hiumbi hivili yehina magwaba kwa mbao za Mielezi, kila chiumbi chavii na utali wa mita mcheche na yapinga, akavivika muchumba cha msopi neju. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Kila ligwaba lavili na utali wa mita hivili na yapinga, pena utali wa mkingisa wa ligwaba limonga mbaka ligwaba lingi ndi wavii mita mcheche na yapinga. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Chiumbi cha pili ndi chavii na utali wa mita mcheche na yapinga, viwumbi vyoha vivili ndi vyavili na hipimu yeyiwanangana na mlolekanu umonga. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Utali wa chiumbi chimonga wavili mita mcheche na yapinga, mewawa utali wa chiwumbi chingi ndi wavili wulawula. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Solomoniavivikili viumbi vyenivyo mugati ya chumba chamsopi neju, vyavili na magwaba gegatalambwiki, ligwaba la chiumbi chimonga likapamisa luwumba lumonga na ligwaba la chiumbi chingi likapamisa luwumba lungi, na magwaba gangi gala gakapamisana pagati ya chumba. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Hiumbi hyeniyo mewa ahinyalili zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Luwumba lwa chumba chamusopi neju na lwa chumba chamsopi azinyambisi kwa kuvika hiumbi yeyinamagwaba na mitende na micholo maluva gegahomwili. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Hata pahi ya vyumba vyenivyo anyalili zahabu, mu chumba chamsopi neju na muchumba chamsopi.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Pakuyingilila Pandu pa Msopi neju apatengenizili mulyangu wa mbawu za mizeituni. Uvaha wa kila mulyangu uyingila mala muhanu ya uvaha wa chumba. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Mumilyangu yeniyo hivili ya mizeituni, acholili viumbi vyevinamagwaba, mitende na maluva gegahomwili, micholo yeniyo ayinyalili zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Mewawa atenganizi hiyimilu ya mlyangu wa kuyingilila pa sebuli weunapandi mcheche zeziwaningini uvaha. Viyimilu vya mulyangu wenuwo vyavili vya mizeituni. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Kwavili na milyangu hivili yeyahotoliki kukunjuka yeyatengenizwi kwa mbao za mibeloshi na kila umonga wavili na bawabu zezauhotwisi ujikunja kila chipandi panani ya chingi. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Panani ya mbawu zenizo acholili viumbi vyevinamagwaba, mitende na maluva gegahomwili akahinyala kwa zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Ajengili luwumba kuyitindila nyumba ya Chapanga na luwumba lwaki lwavili na misitali hidatu ya maganga gegahongoliwi, na musitali umonga wa boliti za mielezi.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Mkingisa wa nyumba ya Chapanga wajengiwi mumwehi wa pili weukemiwa Zifu mumwaka wa mcheche wa utalalila wa nkosi Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga yamalakiswi kujengwa mumwehi wa Buli, manayaki mwehi wa nane, mumwaka wa kumi na umonga, amalakisi kuyijenga nyumba, na lihengu lamaliki ngati cheyapangiwi. Solomoni ajengili nyumba yeniyo mulukumbi lwa miyaka saba.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s">Nyumba ya chinkosi ya Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Solomoni ajengili nyumba yaki ya chinkosi, amalili kuyijengili mulukumbi lwa miyaka kumi na hidatu. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Mewawa akajenga nyumba yingi yeyakemiwi nyumba ya Dasi ya Lebanoni. Yavii na utali wa mita alubaini na mcheche na yapinga, upana waki mita ishilini na hivili na lobo, na utali waki wa kuhamba kunani wavii mita kumi na hidatu na yapinga. Yajengwili panani ya misitali mcheche ya mapanda ga mielezi, mapanda gegakamulili mbagalu za mielezi kwa upandi wa kunena. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Kila musitali wavili na mapanda kumi na muhanu pena goha ndi gavili mapanda alubaini na muhanu, azipamindi dali za mbawu za mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Mupandi zivili za luwumba kila upandi wavili na misitali hidatu ya madilisha gegilolesana. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Milyangu yoha yawanangini uvaha pandi zoha, na felemu za madilisha genago gegalolisini mewa zavili zezinauvaha weuwanangana pandi zoha.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Ajengili libanji la mapanda, utali waki wavili mita ishilini na lobo, na upana waki mita kumi na hidatu na yapinga. Palongolo ya nyumba yeniyo kwavili na libanji.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Solomoni ajengili libanji la chigoda cha unkosi, mwenumo ahamwili mihalu ya vandu. Lenilo lakemiwi Libanji la Uhamula. Lanyambiswi kwa mbawu za mielezi kuhumila pahi mbaka kudali.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Nyumba yaki ya kutama mwene, yeyavili kuyetu ya Libanji la Uhamula, yajengiwi ngati zingi zila. Solomoni ajengili kangi nyumba ngati Libanji lenilo ndava ya mdala waki mweavii msikana wa Falao nkosi wa ku Misili.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Nyumba zenizo zoha zajengiwi kwa maganga gabwina kutumbula pahi mbaka kunani, maganga gegahongoliwi kwa chipimu chechiganikiwa, na kudumuliwa kwa musumenu kuvala na mugati. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Mkingisa wavili wa maganga gavaha na gabwina na geganautali wa mita hidatu na yapinga, na upana mita mcheche. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Pandu pa kunani pajengiwi kwa maganga gangi gegahongoliwi kwa hipimu yeyiganikiwa, na kuvikwa mbao za mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Libanji la nkosi lavili na luhuka lweluna musitali umonga wa mbao za mielezi na misitali hidatu ya maganga gegahongoliwi, ngati cheyavili munyumba ya Chapanga na muchumba chaki cha mugati.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga Hulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Kangi nkosi Solomoni amukemili Hulamu mundu wa ku Tilo. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Mwenuyo avili mwana wa lipwela wa likabila la Nafutali, na dadi waki ndi avili mkolonjinji wa ku Tilo, mweikita lufumbu shaba. Hulamu avili na umanya wamahele na luhala, na mweamanyili kutengeneza chindu chochoha kwa kuhengela shaba. Pena ndi abwelili kwa nkosi Solomoni, akamuhengela mahengu gaki goha.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapanda gavili ga shaba ga munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2 Lus 3:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Hulamu atenganizi mapanda gavili ga shaba, na kila limonga lavili na utali wa mita nane, na utindilu wa mita muhanu na yapinga. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Mewa akawumba njingwa zivili za shaba, kila yimonga yavili na utali wa mita hivili na lobo, akazivika munani ya mapanda genago. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Panani ya kila lipanda kwanyambiswi na ngwanda. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Mewa atenganizi matunda gegalolikini ngati makomamanga, akagapanga misitali hivili kutindila njingwa zila mukila lipanda.<verse eid="1KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Na njingwa zila zezavili munani ya mapanda gegavili palongolo ya sebuli, zapabwili luhumu lwa mauwa gabwina gegimela na kuyevela mumanji, kunyolika kwaki ndi mita yimonga na lobo zidatu. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Njingwa zenizo zavili panani ya mapanda gavili genago, na mewa zavili panani ya mtindilu wewahumalili papipi na ngwanda zila, mewa pavili na vindu vyeviwanangana na makomamanga mia mcheche vyevipangiwi kwa misitali hivili kwa makomamanga miya zivili mu kila mutu wa lipanda limonga.<verse eid="1KI 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Hulamu agavikili mapanda genago pandu pa kuyingilila mu libwanji la nyumba ya Chapanga, lipanda la upandi wa kulyelela lakemiwi Yakini na lipanda la upandi wa kumangeha lakemiwi Boazi. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Mitu ya mapanda genago yapambiwi kwa luhumu lwa mauwa gegimela na kuyevela mumanji.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:22">Penapo ndi lihengu la kutengeneza mapanda likamalika.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihulu chivaha cha shaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 4:2-5">2 Lus 4:2-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Pagenago, Hulamu akatengeneza chihulu chivaha cha shaba chechikemiwa Bahali. Lavili lamuvilingu lelinaupana wa mita mcheche na yapinga kuhumila ukingu mbaka ukingu, na utali wa mita zivili na lobo na mtindilu wa mita kumi na hidatu na yapinga. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Pahi ya chihulu kwatindili misitali hivili ya ndeve zezihumbiwi kwa shaba, ndeve zenizo zatengenizwi pamonga na chihulu. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Chihulu chavikiwi panani ya himong'omong'o kumi na hivili ya ng'ombi higosi hidatu yalolili ku kasikazini na hidatu yalolili kwelitipama lilanga na hidatu yalolili kusini na hidatu yalolili kwelihumila lilanga. Kuni vibuna vyavi vigegili chihulu chenicho. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Unene wa mulomo waki wavili sentimita saba na yapinga, wenuwo wawanangini na mulomo wa chikombi na ngati liluva lelimela na kuyevela mumanji. Chihulu chavili na uhotola wa kumema manji lita elufu alubaini.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matololi ga shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Mewa Hulamu atenganizi matololi kumi ga shaba, kila litololi lavili na utali wa mita yimonga na lobo hidatu na upana wa mita yimonga na lobo hidatu na kunyoleka kwa mita yimonga na lobo. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Matololi genago zatenganizwi kwa mabamba ga shaba gegakamuliwi na felemu za shaba zezivi na utali na upana weuwanana. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Mumihana ya mabamba genago gegakauliwi na felemu, kwavili na himong'omong'o ya lihimba na ng'ombi zigosi na viumbi vyevina magwaba. Himong'omong'o yeniyo ya mahimba na ya ng'ombi higosi hyagubikwi na kutandikwa mapambu gegalukiwi bwina. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Mewa kila litololi lavili na maguludumu mcheche ga shaba, na chindu chechikita maguludumu gagendayi ndi chavii cha shaba. Mukona zoha mcheche za matololi kwavili na vikamulilu vya shaba ndava ya kukamulila chihulu chivaha. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Kwavili na felemu ya mvilingu cha kunani ndava ya kutamila chihulu, utali wa kunani wavili mita yapinga na kuhamba pahi sentimita kumi na nane. Kuutindila mlomo wa chihulu walembiwi, na vitamilu vyaki ndi vyavili vya kona mcheche zeziwanangana. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Na maguludumu mcheche gala ndi gavili pahi ya mabamba ga hyuma na pagati ya maguludumu gala ndi yawunganiswi na litololi lene, na uvaha wa maguludumu genago ndi wavii sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Maguludumu genago gavili ngati maguludumu ga mutuka za ngondo za kuhutwa na hinyama, na hyuma hyaki ya pagati na mitindilu yaki na mataluma gaki na hikombi yaki, vyoha vyenivyo ndi vyavili vya shaba ya kukita lufumbu. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Kwavili na mkamulilu umonga mukila kona ya litololi vyevyawunganisi litololi na liguludumu. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Panani ya kila litololi pavili na utindilu wa shaba weuna uvaha wa sentimita ishilini na hivili pamonga na hikamulilu na mabamba gegavili upandi wa kunani ndi gakamulini na litololi lene. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Mu kila vikamulilu na mumabamba ga kila litololi, Hulamu anyambisi kwa kuchola viwumbi vyevina magwaba na mahimba na hikongo ya mitende, anyambisi kwa kutindisila na njingwa. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Chenicho ndi Hilamu cheatenganizi matololi gala kumi, goha atenganizi kwa shaba, na gawanangini kwa hipimu na kwa mlolekanu.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Mewa Hilamu atenganizi ihulu kumi ya shaba, chihulu chimonga mukila litololi. Kila chihulu chavili na upana wa mita yimonga na yapinga, na chahotwili kumema manji lita miya nane na semanini. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Matololi muhanu agavikili kuupandi wa kulyelela wa nyumba ya Chapanga, na muhanu akagavika kuupandi wa kumangeha wa nyumba ya Chapanga, na chihulu chivaha chechikemiwa Baali achivikili palongolo ku upandi wa kulyela wa nyumba ya Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vindu vya mu nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 4:11-5:1">2 Lus 4:11-5:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Mewa Hulamu awumbili hiviga, sepetu na chihulu chidebe. Penapo Hulamu akamala lihengu leapewili na nkosi Solomoni kuvala nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />Ajengili mapanda gavili na njingwa zivili zezivikiwi panani ya mapanda genago na ngwanda zivili ndava ya kugubika njingwa zivili zenizo, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />na makomamanga miya mcheche ndava ya ngwanda zenizo zivili na misitali hivili ya makomamanga ndava ya kunyambisa njingwa zenizo zivili zezivikwi panani ya mapanda. <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />Mewa atenganizi matololi kumi, na vikamulilu kumi mu matololi genago, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />na chihulu chivaha cha shaba chechikemiwa bahali chechigegiwi panani ya hibuna ya himong'omong'o ya ng'ombi zigosi kumi na hivili, pahi ya litengi lenilo. <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />Viviga vila na sepetu pamonga na chihulu chidebe. vindu vyenivyo vyoha Hulamu vyeamutenganizili nkosi Solomoni ndava ya mu nyumba ya Chapanga, vyoha vyavili vya shaba yeying'asima. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Vindu vyenivyo vyoha nkosi alagizi ku likemba la Yoludani, pandu pepana ludaka lwa kuwumbila viviga pavili pagati ya Sukoti na Saletani. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Solomoni apimili lepi kutopa kwa vindu vyenivi vyoha ndava muni vyavili vyamahele neju, hinu kutopa kwa shaba kwamanyikini lepi.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Mewa Solomoni alagizi vindu vyoha vyevyavili ndava ya mu nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga vitengenezwa kwa zahabu, pandu pa zahabu pa kuwusila teta na meza ya zahabu ndava ya kuvikila mabumunda gakuvika palongolo ya Chapanga, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />hibokoselu ya hahi vya zahabu yabwina vyevyavikiwi palongolo ya Pandu pa Musopi neju, muhanu upandi wa kusini na muhanu upandi wa kasikazini, maluva na hahi na koleu. <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />Hikombi ya zahabu yabwina na mikasi ya kulinganisila utambi za hahi na mankeve ga kunyunyisila na hiyokolelu ya motu na himbani vya kuhukisila ubani, na bawaba za zahabu ndava ya milyangu ya Pandu pa Msopi neju, na mewa ndava ya milyangu ya libanji livaha la mu nyumba ya Chapanga vyenivyo vyoha vyavili vya zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Ndi nkosi Solomoni akamala lihengu loha la mu Nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga. Penapo Solomoni akaleta vindu vyoha vyevyavaguliwi na Daudi dadi waki ndava ya Chapanga, ndi vyavii madini ga feza, na zahabu na hyombo hingi, akavivika muvibana vya Nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku la Lilaganu liletwa mu Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2 Lus 5:2-6:2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Penapo nkosi Solomoni akavakonganesa palongolo yaki uko ku Yelusalemu vagogo na vachilongosi voha va makabila na vakulu va lukolo za Isilaeli, ndava valiwusayi Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga mu muji wa Daudi, yaani Siyoni. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Vandu voha va pa Isilaeli vakakonganeka kwa nkosi Solomoni lukumbi lwa mselebuko, mumwehi wa saba weukemiwa Etanimu. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Pevamalili kubwela vagogo voha va pa Isilaeli, ndi vamteta vakaligega Lisanduku la Lilaganu, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />Valawi pamonga na vamteta valiwusili Lisanduku la Lilaganu na lindanda la kukonganekela, pamonga na vyombo vyoha vyamusopi vyevyavili mulindanda lenilo. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Nkosi Solomoni na vandu voha va Isilaeli vakakonganeka palongolo ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu, na vene vakawusa luteta za ng'ombi na mambelele vyangavalangika. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Pena vamteta vakaliyingisa Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga pahali paki, Pandu pa Msopi neju, pahi ya magwaba ga hiumbi. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Viumbi vyenivyo magwaba gaki gadandiswi panani ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu, hinu Lisanduku pamonga na hikamulilu yaki ya kugegela vyavili pahi ya magwaba. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Muni hikamulilu yeniyo yavili hitali neju, ndi yawonikini mbaka palongolo ya pandu Pamsopi neju, nambu vyawonikini lepi kuupandi wa kuvala. Vigegelu vyenivyo vyakona vivi pandu penapo mbaka lelu. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Kwavili lepi na chindu chingi mugati ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu nambu ndi vibawu vivili vya maganga vyeavikili Musa tangia ku Holebu, pandu pala Bambu Chapanga peakitili lilaganu na Vaisilaeli pevahumayi kumlima wa Misili.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Vamteta pevahumayi mu pandu pamusopi neju, bahopo lihundi likamema mu Nyumba ya kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Na vene vamteta vahotwili lepi kuhenga lihengu la chimteta ndava ya lihundi lenilo, muni umsopi wa Bambu Chapanga wamemili mwenumo. <verse eid="1KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Ndi Solomoni akayupa na kujova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">“Veve Bambu Chapanga wavikili lilanga kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">hinu uhagwili kutama mu mahundi na muchitita ng'ong'ololo. <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Chakaka nikujengili nyumba ya kutama, pandu peutama magono goha gangali na mwisu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni ilongela na vandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:3-11">2 Lus 6:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Kangi Solomoni akavang'anamukila mngonganu woha wa Vaisilaeli pevavili vayimili, akavamotisa. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Akajova, “Alumbiwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ndava kwa makakala gaki atimilisi gala geamuhaidili dadi wangu Daudi, muni ajovili, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Tangia nivawusili vandu vangu va Isilaeli kuhuma kumlima wa Misili, nahagwili lepi muji wowoha mumakabila ga Isilaeli muni nijengewayi nyumba ya kunifugamilila, nambu namuhagwili Daudi avatalalilayi vandu vangu va Isilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />Solomoni akayendelela kujova, “Dadi wangu Daudi aganili kuyijenga nyumba ya kumfugamilila Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga amujovili dadi wangu Daudi, ‘Muni waganili kujenga nyumba ndava ya kunifugamila, wakitili chabwina kuvika lenilo mumutima waku. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Nambu ukunijengela lepi veve, yati akunijengela mwana waku mweukumvelekayi wamwene.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />Na hinu Bambu Chapanga atimilisi ahadi yaki, na nene niyimili pahali pa dadi wangu Daudi na lelu nichitamili chigoda cha unkosi cha Isilaeli, ngati cheahaidili Bambu Chapanga, na nene nijengili nyumba ya kumufugamila Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Neju ya genago, nitenganizi pandu pa kulivika Lisanduku la Lilaganu, mugati yaki muna hipandi ya maganga ya lilaganu leakaitili Bambu Chapanga na vagogo vitu, lukumbi peavawusayi kumulima wa Misili.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luyupu lwa Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:12-42">2 Lus 6:12-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Kangi, Solomoni akayima palongolo ya pandu pa kuwusila teta pa Bambu Chapanga kuni vandu voha va Isilaeli vakumulola, akayinula mawoko gaki kunani, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />akajova, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, kawaka Chapanga yungi ngati veve, kunani kwaku amala pahi pamulima! Veve wamusadikika, muni utimilisi lilaganu laku na kuvalangisa ubwina waku kwa vahengaji vaku na kukuyidikila kwa mtima wavi woha. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Utimilisi ahadi yaku yewayivikili kwa muhengaji waku dadi wangu Daudi, kwa makakala gaku lelu utimilisi gala goha gewajovili. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />Hinu, veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isiaeli, nikukuyupa mewa uyitimilisayi ahadi yila yewamuhaidili muhengaji waku dadi wangu Daudi, pewajovili, ‘Magono goha yati uvya na mvelekwa wa kutama pachigoda chaku cha unkosi wa Isilaeli, yikavyayi viveleku vyaku yati vivya vasadikika mu matendu gavi palongolo yangu ngati veve cheuvii wamsadikika palongolo yangu.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Hinu, veve Chapanga wa Isilaeli, chondi ugatimilisayi gala goha gewamuhaidili muhengaji waku dadi wangu Daudi.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />Wu, veve Chapanga yati utama pamulima? Yikavyayi hati kunani kwaku kwekuvii kunani neju kwene kukutosha lepi, ndi yati yikukukola wuli nyumba iyi yidebe yeniyijengili? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Pamonga na naha Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, nene namuhengaji waku uyuwanilayi kuyupa kwangu na kunitimisila luyupu lwangu lwenikukuyupa lelu. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Uyiyungayi nyumba iyi muhi na kilu, pandu peujovili, ‘Penapo ndi vandu pevakunifugamila nene.’ Uniyuwanilayi nene paniyupa kwa kuangalia mahali hapa. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Uyuwanilayi luyupu lwa muhengaji waku na lwa vandu vaku va Isilaeli lukumbi peviyupa kwa kulola pandu apa. Uyuwanayi luyupu peuvya kunani kwaku, na ukamalayi kuyuwana utihengela lipyana.”<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Mundu akamubudilayi muyaki, na mwene akaletwayi ndava ya kulapa palongolo ya pandu pa kuwusila teta mu nyumba iyi, na mwene akalapayi, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />chondi veve Bambu Chapanga uyuwanilayi kuhumila kukwoko kunani kwaku, ukita chechiganikiwa kuvahamula vahengaji vaku. Mweahokili umubunayi kulandana na kuhoka kwaki, mweangahoka umulekekesayi na kumukitila ubwina kulandana na usadika kwaki.”<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“Yikavyayi vandu vaku va Isilaeli vabuniwi na vamakoko vavi ndava ya gahakahu gevakuhengili, vakang'anamuka na kubwela mu Nyumba yeniyi, vakafugamayi kwaku kukuyupa kulekekeswa na kulilumba liina laku, vakakitayi chenicho kwa ungolongondi Nyumba yeniyi, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />ndi uvayuwanilayi kuhumila kukwo kunani kwaku. Uvawonelayi lipyana vandu vaku va Isilaeli ndava ya kukubudila kwavi, na uvakiliwusayi kumulima wewavapelili vagogo vavi.”<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“Fula yikabelayi kutonya ndava ya kukubudila kwavi, vakang'anamuka na kulola pandu apa na kulilumba liina laku, kuyupa na kukufugamila, mewa vakalekayi kubuda kwavi peukuvabuna, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />chondi uvayuwanilayi kuhumila kunani kwaku, na ulekekesayi kubuda kwa vahengaji vaku, vandu vaku va Isilaeli. uvawula njila ya bwina ya kutama na ukatonyesa fula panani ya mulima weuvapelili vandu vaku uvya wavi.”<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Lukumbi mulima peuvya na uyumu amala yikahotola kutonya fula mbaka mabenu gakawola amala matamu gahakau gakadandasika mu vandu. Lukumbi lungi mimeya yihotola yikahalibika kwa kuliwa na mambalanguli pamonga na mabungu, vandu vaku vihotola vakazangiwa mumilima yavi. Vandu vaku vihotola kuvya vatamu, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />chondi, uyuwanilayi kuyupa kwokwoha kwa vandu vaku va Isilaeli, amala mundu yoyoha akamanyayi mang'aiso ga mumtima waki, akakuyupai kuni atalambwisi mawoko gaki kulangisa kunyumba yeniyi <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />hinu uyuwanilayi tangia kunani kwaku uko, na uvalekekesa. Mewa umukitilayi kila mundu ngati cheiganikiwa, muni veve ndu ndi mweumanya maholo ga kila mundu, <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />muni vakuyidakilayi lukumbi lwoha lwevitama pamulima wewavapelili vagogo vavi.”<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />“Mewawa, lukumbi muyehe akabwela kuhuma ku mulima wa kutali ndava ya mambu gavaha geuvakitili vandu vaku na akavya pagati ya vandu vaku va Isilaeli, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />muni vandu va milima hingi yati viyuwana kulumbiwa kwaku na kuvala makakala na uhotola waku, mundu mwenuyo akabwelayi na kuyupa kuni ilolokesa nyumba yeniyi, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />chondi umuyuwanilayi kuhuma kunani kwaku, na umuhengelayi muyehe mwenuyo goha geakuyupa muni vandu voha va pamulima vahotola kumanya mambu gavaha geuvakitili na kukuyidakila ngati chevikita vandu vaku va Isilaeli, na Vandu voha vamanya kuvya nyumba yeniyi yeniyijengili, ndava ya mambu gavaha geuvakitili.”<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Lukumbi vandu vaku pevihamba kungondo kutovana na vamakoko vavi, kwokwoha kweukuvapelekayi, ngati vakakuyupayi kuuyelekela muji weuwuhagwili na nyumba yeniyijengili ndava ya liina laku, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />nikuyupa uyuwanilayi kuyupa kwavi kukwoko kunani kwaku, uvapela uhotola kungondo.”<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Nambu vakakukitilayi uhakahu muni kawaka mundu mweangakita uhakahu, na veve ukavalekayi vabuniwayi va vamakoko, na kukamuliwa kupelekwa ku muji weuvii kutali amala papipi, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />pevivya kwenuko vakang'anamusa mitima yavi na kufugama kwa kukuyupa lipyana, kujova, ‘Tikitili gahakahu, tiyagili na kukita gangaganikiwa,’ <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />mewa lukumbi lwenulo lwevivya kumulima wa makoko vavi, vakayupayi lipyana kwa mitima yavi yoha na kwa mipungu yavi yoha, na ngati vakukuyupa kuni viyelekela kumulima wavi wewavapelili vagogo vavi, vakayelekelayi ku mulima uwu wewauhagwili na Nyumba yeniyi yeniyijengili ndava ya liina laku, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />ndi nikukuyupa uyuwanilayi kuyupa kwavi na uvahengelayi lipyana. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Uvalekekese vandu vaku kukubudila kwavi na uhakahu wavi, uvawonelayi lipyana palongolo ya vamakoko vavi, na kuvakita vamakoko vavi vavawonela lipyana. <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />Muni venava ndi vandu vaku na vewavawusili ku Misili kuhuma mu litanulu la kuyeyusila lyuma.”<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />“Yuwanilayi luyupu lwa nene muhengaji waku na luyupu lwa vandu vaku va Isilaeli, uvayuwanilayi kila pevakukuyupa uvatangatilayi. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Ndava muni, veve Bambu Chapanga wavavagwili pagati ya vandu va milima yingi va pamulima, ndava vavyayi vandu vaku ngati chewakokwisi kwa kupitila mtumisi waku Musa, lukumbi lula lwewavawusili vagogo vitu kumulima wa Misili.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni avamotisa vandu vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Solomoni peamalili kumyupa Bambu Chapanga palongolo ya pandu pa kuwusila teta, akayima pala peafugimi kuni akwesili mawoko gaki kunani. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Akayima na kuvamotisa Vaisilaeli voha vevakonganiki penapo, kuni ijova kwa lwami luvaha, <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Alumbiwayi Bambu Chapanga mweavapelili uteke vandu vaki va Iisilaeli, kulandana na lilaganu laki. Akitili goha gabwina geajovili kupitila mtumisi waki Musa. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga witu, avyayi na tete ngati cheavili na vagogo vitu, tiyupa akoto kutileka amala akoto kutitaga. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Mwene ayikita mitima yitu yivya yeyikumsadika mwene, muni tilandayi njila zaki kwa kuyidakila malagizu gaki na mihilu yaki na uhamula waki geavapelili vagogo vitu. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Hinu malovi gangu genaga geniyupili kwa Bambu Chapanga ndi gavyayi papipi na Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga witu, muhi na kilu, na mwene aniyunga nene muhengaji waki pamonga na vandu vaki va Vaisilaeli, muni vapatayi vindu vyoha vyevigana magono goha. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Na vandu va milima yoha yati vimanya chakaka kuvya Bambu Chapanga, ndi Chapanga na kawaka yungi. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Na nyenye muvyayi mwavasadika kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga witu, mulanda mihilu yaki na kuyidakila malagizu gaki goha ngati chemwikita lelu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyumba ya Chapanga yinyambiswa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2 Lus 7:4-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Kangi, nkosi Solomoni pamonga na Vaisilaeli voha vevavili pamonga nayu vakamuwusila Bambu Chapanga teta. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Na mwene Solomoni akamuwusila Bambu Chapanga teta ya kutana cha uteke, ng'ombi elufu ishilini na hivili na mambelele laki yimonga na elufu ishilini. Chenicho ndi nkosi Solomoni pamonga na Vaisilaeli voha chevayinyambisi Nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Ligono lilolo nkosi Solomoni akanyambisa uwa ya pagati yeyavili palongolo ya nyumba ya Chapanga, penapo ndi peawusalili teta za kutinyiswa, teta za mabenu na mahuta ga hinyama na teta za uteke, ndava yeniyo ndi pandu pa kuwusila teta pa shaba pavili padebe ndi patosili lepi teta zenizo zoha.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Hinu Solomoni akakita mselebuko mwene pamonga na vandu voha va Isilaeli, msambi uvaha neju, vandu kuhuma ku Lebo Hamati yeyivi upandi wa kasikazini mbaka mfuleni udebe wa Misili weuvi upandi wa kusini. Vakakita mselebuko palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga kwa magono saba na vakayongesa magono saba gangi. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Muligono la nane mu magono gala saba gevayonjokisi Solomuni akavalaga vandu na vene vakamtakila mota nkosi, vakahamba kunyumba yavi kuni viluluta na kusangaluka mu mitima yavi ndava ya mambu goha geavakitili Bambu Chapanga ndava ya Daudi mtumisi waki pamonga na vandu vaki wa Vaisilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Bambu Chapanga akumuhumalila kangi Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2 Lus 7:11-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Nkosi Solomoni peamalili kujenga nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga, na nyumba ya chinkosi na majengu gangi goha geaholalili kugajenga, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />Bambu Chapanga akamuhumalila kangi ngati cheamuhumalili ku Gibeoni. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Bambu Chapanga akamujovela, “Nikuyuwini kuyupa kwaku na kufugama kwaku, niyinyambisi nyumba iyi yeunijengili ndava vandu vangu valiyupa liina langu magono goha mwenumu. Yati nikuyiyangalila na kuyiyunga nyumba iyi magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Na veve ngati ukanihengelayi cha uchakaka ngati cheanihengili Daudi dadi waku, ukayidakilayi malagizu gangu na kukita gala goha genikulagisi, ukalandayi mihilu yangu, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />penapo nene yati nikuchikangamalisa chigoda chaku cha unkosi magono goha gangali na mwisu, ngati chenamuhaidili Daudi dadi waku, nikajova, ‘Yati ukosa lepi mundu mu chiveleku wa kutama pachigoda chaku cha unkosi wa Paisilaeli.’ <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Nambu veve amala vana vaku mukang'anamukayi na kuleka kunilanda, mukalekayi kukamula malagizu gangu na mihilu yenivapelili, mukahambayi kuifugamila michapanga hingi, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />ndi yati nikuvataga Vaisilaeli kutali vawuka pamulima uwu wenivapelili, na nene yati nikuyibela nyumba iyo yeniyinyambisi ndava ya kunifugamila nene. Ndi Vaisilaeli yati vivya vandu va kubelalewana vandu na kuveveswa na vandu voha. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Na nyumba yeniyi yati yibomoka na kuvya mang'ova kila mweipita papipi yaki yati ikenyemuka na kunyugusa mitu na kukota, ‘Ndava kyani Bambu Chapanga aukitili naha mulima uwu na nyumba yeniyi?’ <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Vandu vangi yati viyangula, ‘Ndava muni vamulekili Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wavi, mweavawusili vagogo vavi kumulima wa Misili, vakavya na michapanga hingi na vakahifugamila, ndavayeniyo ndi Bambu Chapanga avaletili mubunu uwu.’”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni iyidakilana na Hulamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 8:1-2">2 Lus 8:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Miyaka ishilini yikamalika yeahengalili Solomoni kujenga nyumba zivili, nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga na nyumba ya unkosi, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />nkosi Solomoni amupelili Hilamu nkosi wa ku Tilo, miji ishilini mumukoa wa Galilaya, ndava muni Hilamu amupelekili nkosi Solomoni mbawu za mielezi na za miboleshi pamonga na zahabu ngati chaeganili ndava ya kujengela. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Nambu Hilamu peabwelili kuhuma ku Tilo na peahiweni miji yeniyo yeapewili na Solomoni, aganiswi nayu lepi. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Ndi akamukota Solomoni, “Mulongo wangu mboni unipelili miji yeyangavya yabwina?” Ndi mana miji yeniyo yikemiwa Kabuli mana yaki hihakahu mbaka lelu. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Hilamu ampelekili nkosi Solomoni zahabu kilo elufu muhanu.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu gangi ga Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 8:3-18">2 Lus 8:3-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Aga ndi makokoso kuvala mahengu ga kulazimisa, gala nkosi Solomoni geavahengisi vandu ndava ya kuyijenga nyumba ya Chapanga, na nyumba yaki ya chinkosi na ngomi ya Milo na luwumba lwa Yelusalemu, na muji wa ku Hazoli na wa ku Megido pamonga namuji wa ku Gezeli. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Gezeli ndi muji wula weaukamwili Falao nkosi wa ku Misili, akauyocha motu na kuvakomakesa Vakanaani vevavili mwenumo. Mwanakandahi msikana wa Falao peagegiwi na nkosi Solomoni, ndi Falao akamupela msikana waki muji wa Gezeli kuvya njombi ya mutimbu wa ndowa. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Ndi nkosi Solomoni akaujenga kavili muji wa Gezeli mewawa akajenga na Beti Holoni ya pahi, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />mewawa ajengili muji wa Baalati na muji wa Tamali yeyavili kulugangatu papipi na mulima waki. <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />Miji yaki yoha ndava ya hibana, miji ndava ya mutuka zaki za ngondo za kuhutwa na hinyama, na miji ndava ya vakwela falasi, mewa na vyoha vyeaganili kuvijenga ku Yelusalemu, ku Lebanoni na ku kila pandu peatalalili. <verse eid="1KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Vandu vangi voha vevasigalili mumi kuhuma kwa Vaamoli, Vahiti na Vapelizi na Vahivi na Vayebusi, vandu venavo vavili Vaisilaeli lepi, <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />pamonga na viveleku vyavi vyevyangakomiwa na Vaisilaeli, Solomoni avahengisi mahengu cha kuvang'anga'anisa mbaka lelu. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Nambu pagati ya Vaisilaeli Solomoni amukitili lepi hati mundu mumonga kuvya mvanda, Vaisilaeli ndi vavii manjolinjoli vaki na vahengaji vaki na vakekesi vaki va ngondo na vilongosi va pahi yaki na vakekesi va mumutuka zaki za kuhutwa na vandu vaki va kukwela falasi.<verse eid="1KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Mewa vavili vavilongosi vakulu va kuyimamila miladi ya Solomoni, vayimamila miya muhani na hamusini ndi vavayimamili vandu vevahengayi mahengu ga kung'ang'aniswa.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Mwanakandahi msikana wa Falao akawuka mumuji wa Daudi na kuhamba kutama munyumba ya chinkosi yeayijengili Solomoni, kangi Solomoni akajenga ngome ya Milo.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Solomoni awusili teta za kutinyiswa na teta za uteke mala zidatu mu kila mwaka pandu pa kuwusila teta peamujengili Bambu Chapanga, akamuhukisila Bambu Chapanga ubani, kangi akamalikisa kujenga nyumba.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Nkosi Solomoni atenganizi watu zamahele uko ku Ezioni Gebeli, papipi na ku Eloti yeyivili kumbwani ya nyanja ya Shamu kumulima wa ku Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Na mwene nkosi Hilamu akavatuma vandu vaki vevamanyili kuhenga mahengu mu watu pamonga na vahengaji va Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />vakagenda munyanja mbaka ku mulima wa Ofili na kwenuko vakatola zahabu kilo elufu kumi na mcheche na vakamuletela nkosi Solomoni.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Malikiya wa ku Sheba akumgendelela Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Lus 9:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Malikiya wa ku Sheba peayuwini kulumbiwa kwa Solomoni ndava ya nyumba ya kumfugamilila Bambu Chapanga, akamuhambila Solomoni ndava ya kumulinga kwa makotesi ganonopu. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Akahika ku Yelusalemu kuni alongosini na vandu vamahele pamonga na ngamiya zezagegili mahuta geginungalila neju na zahabu zamahele neju pamonga na maganga gegiguliswa kwa mashonga gamahele neju. Peakonganiki na Solomoni ndi akamukota makotesi geginonopa gamahele geavii nagu. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Na mwene Solomoni akagayangula makotesi goha, kawaka likotesi lealeki kuliyangula. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Malikiya wa ku Sheba akangichi neju pealuweni luhala lwa Solomoni pamonga na nyumba ya chinkosi yeayijengili, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />kangi peaweni chakulya chechiletwi ndava yaki, na vakulu vevavii pahi yaki chevatamili na vahengaji chevihengela na chevawalili na mewa vevigega minyweso yaki na teta za kutinyiswa zila zeaziwusili munyumba ya Bambu Chapanga, akavya lwee na kukangasa neju. <verse eid="1KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Pena akamujovela nkosi Solomoni, “Mambu goha genagayuwini tangia kumulima wangu kuvala mahengu gaku na luhala lwaku, ndi ga chakaka! <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Nambu nahotwili lepi kugasadika mambu genago mbaka penabwelili na kugalola namwene. Kumbi genajoviwi gahikili lepi hata yapinga gaki, luhala lwaku na vindu vyamahele vyeuvii navyu vivi neju ya genayuwini. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Vamotiswi vandu vaku! Mewa vamotiswi vahengaji vaku vevakuhengela lukumbi lwoha muni viyuwanila luhala lwaku lukumbi lwoha! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Alumbiwayi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, mweaganiswi na veve, akakuvika panani ya chigoda cha unkosi cha pa Isilaeli! Muni Bambu Chapanga ayiganili Isilaeli magono goha gangali ni mwisu, akuvikili veve uvyayi wa nkosi ndava ukita gabwina na gachakaka magonogoha.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Penapo malikiya wa ku Sheba akamupela nkosi Solomoni zahabu kilo elufu mcheche, mahuta gamahele geginungalila bwina na maganga ga mashonga gamahele. Mahuta gati genago geginungalila bwina katu ahumalili lepi kavili mundu wa kugaleta.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Mewa watu za Hilamu zaletili zahabu kuhuma ku Ofili, zaletili mikongo yamahele yeyikemiwa misandali na maganga ga mashonga gamahele. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Na mwene nkosi Solomoni ayihengalili mikongo yeniyo ya msandali kwa kutangatila kujenga nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga, na nyumba yaki ya chinkosi, na mewa atenganizili kanjeke na malimba ga vandu veviyimbi. Mikongo yamahele ya misandali ngati yeniyo yawonikini lepi kavili kuletwa na mundu mbaka lelu.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Na mwene nkosi Solomoni akamupela malikiya wa ku Sheba kila chindu cheanogili na cheaganili, mewawa amupelili pamonga na vindu vingi vyeaganili kumpela kulandana na mtima waki cheuvili wabwina. Ndi malikiya akawuya kumulima waki pamonga na vahengaji vaki.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vindu vyamahele vya nkosi Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">2 Lus 9:13-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Kila mwaka nkosi Solomoni apokelayi zahabu kilo elufu ishilini na zivili. <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />Mewawa apokili zahabu kuhuma kwa vandu vevigulisa na kwa vandu vevigulisa chidogo chidogo na kuhuma kwa vankosi voha va ku Alabia na kuhuma kwa vakulu va mikoa ya Isilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Nkosi Solomoni atenganizi hingwamba hivaha miya zivili na kuhinyala zahabu yabwina, na kila chingwamba chavili na zahabu yeyina utopo wa kilo saba. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Mewa, atenganizi hingwamba hidebehidebe miya zidatu na kuhinyala zahabu yabwina, na kila chingwamba chavili na zahabu yeyina utopo wa kilo yimonga na yapinga, na penapo nkosi akahivika munyumba yeyikemiwa Nyumba ya Dasi ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Kangi nkosi atenganizi chigoda kwa kutumila minu ga ndembu, akachinyala zahabu yabwina. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Chigoda chenicho chavili na hikwelelu kumi na tisa. Upandi wa kunani watindiswi na chavikiwi pandu pa kuyegemesela mawoko mumihana ya pandi zoha zivili zavili na himong'omong'o ya mahimba gegayimili pandi zoha zivili kuni na kuni. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Mewa kwavili na himong'omong'o kumi na hivili ya mahimba hiyimili pandu pa kukwelela pandi zoha, mahimba gavili mukila chikwelelu chimonga upandi uwu na chingi upandi uwu. Chigoda ngati chenicho chitenganizwi lepi muunkosi wowoha mbaka lelu.<verse eid="1KI 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Vindu vyoha vya kunywilila manji vya nkosi Solomoni vyavili vya zahabu, na vyombo vyoha vyevyavili ku nyumbu ya dasi ya Lebanoni vyavili vya zahabu yabwina, chavili lepi chechatenganizwi kwa madini ga feza muni madini ga feza lukumbi lwenulo galolikini kuvya chindu lepi. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Nkosi Solomoni avili na watu zamahele zahamba ku Talishishi zagega vindu, zezalongosini na watu za nkosi Hilamu. Mu kila miyaka hidatu zakiliwukayi mala yimonga na zamugegeleyi zahabu na madini ga feza na mangelu ga ndembu na mayani pamonga na matumbili.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Nkosi Solomoni avi na vindu vyamahele na luhala neju ya vankosi voha va pa mulima. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Vandu va milima yoha vanogili kumuhambila nkosi Solomoni ndava ya kumuyuwanila luhala lwaki lweapewili na Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Vandu voha vamuletili njombi, vindu vya madini ga feza na vya zahabu na nyula na vindu vya ngondo na viungu vyevinungalila bwina na falasi na punda falasi. Njombi zenizo azipokili kila mwaka.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Solomoni akusinyi mutuka zezihutwa na falasi elufu yimonga na miya mcheche pamonga na vandu vevigendesa falasi elufu kumi na zivili, vyenivyo vyoha vyavili ku Yelusalemu kweitama nkosi pamonga na miji hingi hila. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Uko ku Yelusalemu, nkosi Solomoni akakita madini ga feza gavya chindu cha kawaida, na mbao za mielezi zikavya zamahele ngati mbawu za mikuyu ya ku hitumbi hidebehidebe yehivii ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Falasi za Solomoni ndi zaletwili kuhuma ku Misili na kuhuma ku Kue, vagulisaji va chinkosi ndi vavagulili kuhuma ku Kue. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Mutuka yimonga ya kuhutwa na falasi ya ku Misili yaguliwi kwa madini ga feza kilo saba, na falasi yimonga yaguliwi kwa madini ga feza kilo zivili. Vagulisaji va nkosi Solomoni vahambili kuvagulisila mutuka na falasi zenizo vankosi va ku milima ya Vahiti na Vasilia.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni akumleka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Nkosi Solomoni avaganili neju vadala va chiyehe. Pamonga kuvya amugegili msikana wa Falao nambu avagegili na vadala vangi va kumilima ya Vamoabu na Vaamoni na Vaedomu na Vasidoni na Vahiti, <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />vadala va milima yila Bambu Chapanga avabesili Vaisilaeli na kuvajovela, “Mkotoka kugega kwa venavo na venavo vakotoka kugega kwinu ndava muni vadala venavo yati ving'anamusa mitima yinu muni muhihengela michapanga yavi.” Nambu Solomoni avaganili neju vadala venavo. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Solomoni akavya na vadala miya saba, vasikana va chinkosi na vadala va kuvala miya zidatu, vadala venavo ndi vakamng'anamusa mtima. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Muni peayendelelayi kuvya mugogolo, vadala vaki vakamuyagisa na akaihengela michapanga hingi, na avili lepi mchakaka kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waki, ngati dadi waki Daudi cheavili mchakaka. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Solomoni amfugamili Ashitaloti mweavili chapanga wa chidala wa Vasidoni, na kufugamili Milikomu mweavi yomeso wa Vaamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Chenicho ndi Solomoni cheakitili gahakahu palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, ndava alandili lepi cha uchakaka cheigana Bambu Chapanga ngati dadi waki Daudi cheakitili. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Panani ya chitumbi chechivili kuupandi welihumila lilanga wa ku Yelusalemu, Solomoni ajengili pandu pa kumtetela Kemoshi, mweavii yomeso wa Vamoabu, na pandu pa kumtetela Moleki mweavii yomeso wa Vaamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Mewawa avajengili vadala vaki voha pandu pa kuhukisila ubani na pa kutetela michapanga yavi.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Ndi, Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, akamuyomela Solomoni, ndava muni amulekili Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Vaisilaeli, mweamuhumalili mala zivili. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />Bambu Chapanga amulagizi Solomoni akotoka kuifugamila michapanga ya chiyehe, Solomoni ayidakili lepi lilagizu la Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Penapo Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Solomoni, “Ndavamuni ukitili genaga, ulekili lilaganu langu na veve na ugalekili genakulagisi, chakaka yati nikukunyaga unkosi waku na yati nikumupela mmonga wa vahengaji vaku. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Ndava ya gala geakitili dadi waku Daudi yati nikita lepi naha lukumbi veve wakona mumi, nambu yati nikuutola unkosi waku peitalalila mwana waku. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Mewa yati nikuutola lepi kwaki unkosi woha, nambu yati nikumlekela likabila limonga ndava ya Daudi muhengaji wangu na kwa ndava ya Yelusalemu muji weniuhagwili uvya wangu.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamakoko va Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akamukita Hadadi mweavili wa lukolo lwa nkosi wa ku Edomu, avya likoko wa Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Miyaka yamahele yayipitili, lukumbi Daudi peatovanayi na Vaedomu, ndi Yoabu mkekesi waki wa ngondo, akahamba kwenuko kuvahila vevakomiwi. Yoabu avakomili vagosi voha va Vaedomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yoabu pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki vakatama kwenuko kwa lukumbi lwa miyehi sita, ndava ahotola kuvakomakesa njwee vagosi voha va Vaedomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Nambu Hadadi mweavili msongolo ndu lukumbi lwenulo ndi akajumbalili ku Misili pamonga na vahengaji va dadi waki. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Hadadi pamonga na vayaki vakagenda kuhuma ku Midiani, vakavatola na vandu vangi ku Palani, vakahamba navu mbaka ku Misili kwa nkosi wa mulima wenuwo. Falao akamupela Hadadi nyumba, akalagisa apewayi chakulya, akamupela na ndima. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Falao akaganiswa neju na Hadadi. Ndi Falao akamugegesa Hadadi mlamu waki, mbena wa Tapenesi, mdala waki. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Mwenuyo mbena wa Tapenesi akamuvelekela Hadadi mwana wa chigosi mweakemiwi Genubati. Tapenesi amulelili Genubati munyumba ya chinkosi, pamonga na vana va Falao.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Nambu Hadadi peavili ku Misili akayuwana kuvya Daudi na Yoabu mkulu wa manjolinjoli vahovili, akamujovela Falao, “Unilekekesayi nikiliwukayi kunyumba yangu.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Nambu Falao akamukota, “Chindu kiki chenibelili kukupela mbaka uyupa kukiliwuka kunyumba yaku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Namwene, Hadadi akayangula, “Unilekekesa ndu nikiliwukayi kunyumba yangu!”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Chapanga akamukita mewa Lezoni mwana wa Eliada kuvya likoko wa Solomoni. Lezoni amutilili nkosi waki, Hadadezeli nkosi wa ku Soba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Lukumbi Daudi peakomili vandu ku Soba, Lezoni akavatola vandu na kuvakita vavyayi manjolinjoli vaki na mwene ndi akavya mkekesi wavi. Ndi vakahamba ku Damasiko, vakatama kwenuko na vakamukita Lezoni avyayi nkosi wa ku Damasiko. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Lezoni avili likoko wa Isilaeli lukumbi lwoha lwa utalalila wa Solomoni, amng'ahili neju Solomoni ngati cheang'ahiwi na Hadadi. Ndi Lezoni atalalilayi mulima wa Silia na akauvevesa neju mlima wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga akumuhaidila Yeloboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Yeloboamu mwana wa Nebati, wa likabila la Efulaimu wa ku Seleda, muhengaji wa Solomoni, nyinawaki ndi lipwela, mweakemiwayi Zelua, na mwene amuhokili nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Chechamukitili amng'anamukila nkosi ndi chavili, Solomoni peahengayi lihengu na kuvika bwina muji wa ku Milo, na kudiva bwina luhumba lwa muji wa Daudi dadi waki, <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Yeloboamu awonikini kuvya msongolo mweavii ngangali na mkekesi. Penapo Solomoni peaweni kuvya msongolo avii chenicho, ndi akamuvika avyayi muyimamila wa vandu va vevahenga mahengu ga kung'ang'aniswa va likabila la Manase na Efulaimu, vevavi vana va Yosefu. <verse eid="1KI 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Ligono limonga Yeloboamu peavili mulugendu kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, munjila akakonganeka na mteta Ahiya wa ku Shilo, mweawalili ligwanda laki la mupya. Vakavya vavili ndu kumigunda. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Penapo Ahiya akalihula ligwanda laki la mupya na kuliyepula hipandi kumi na hivili. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Na akamujovela Yeloboamu, “Tola hipandi kumi ihi muni Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ijova naha, ‘Lola nivi papipi kuupapula na kuuwusa unkosi kwa Solomoni, na nene yati nikukupela veve makabila kumi.’ <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Nambu Vaisilaeli yati viyendelela kulitalalila likabila limonga, ndava muni namuahidili Daudi mweanihengili bwina na ndava ya Yelusalemu muji weniuhagwilionga kuhuma mu miji yoha ya Isilaeli kuvya muju wa vandu vevakunifugamila nene. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Yati nikita chenicho muni Solomoni anilekili, na ahifugamili michapanga ya chiyehe, Ashitaloti mchapanga wa chidala wa Vasidoni na Kemoshi mchapanga wa Vamoabu na Milikomu mchapanga wa Vaamoni. Solomoni anihokili na akitili gahakahu palongolo yangu, na ayidakili lepi mihilu na malagizu gangu, ngati cheaniyidakili Daudi dadi waki. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Nambu yati nikumuwusila lepi unkosi woha muwumi waki, ndava ya muhengaji wangu Daudi mwenamuhagwili, muni alandili malagizu gangu na akitili gegiganikiwa. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Hinu yati nikumunyaga mwana waki unkosi wenuwo, na nene yati nikukupela veve makabila kumi ugatalalilayi. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Mwana wa Solomoni yati nikumulekela likabila limonga muni lukumbi lwoha viveleku vya Daudi vavyayi vatalalila pa Yelusalemu, avyayi chimuli chechiloleka lukumbi lwoha palongolo yangu mumuji wenuwuhagwili uvyayi pandu pa kunifugamila. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Hinu, veve Yeloboamu, yati nikukukita uvyayi nkosi wa Isilaeli, na veve yati utalalila ngati cheugana. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Ngati ukayuwanilayi na kuyidakila goha genikulagiza, yikavya yati utama ngati chenigana na ngati yati ukita gabwina palongolo yangu kwa kukita malagizu gangu na mihilu yangu, ngati muhengaji wangu Daudi cheahengili, nene yati nivya pamonga na veve magono goha. Na yati nikukupela mulima wa Isilaeli na kuukita utalalila waku uvyayi ngangali ngati chenamukitili Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Yati nikuvabuna viveleku vya Daudi ndava ya uhakau wa Solomoni, nambu lepi magono goha.”<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Ndava yeniyo Solomoni alingili kumukoma Yeloboamu, nambu Yeloboamu akatilalila ku Misili kwa Shishaki nkosi wa Misili, akatama kwenuko mbaka Solomoni peafwili.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni ifwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2 Lus 9:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Mambu gangi goha geagahengili Solomoni na luhala lwaki, gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Matendu ga Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Solomoni atalalili pa Isilaeli kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka alubaini, na atamayi ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Solomoni akafwa na kuzikiwa ku muji wa Daudi dadi waki. Leoboamu mwana wa Solomoni ndi akavya nkosi pahala pa dadi waki.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ga ku kukasikazini gakumng'anamukila Lehoboamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2 Lus 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Penapo Lehoboamu akahamba ku Shekemu kwevakonganiki Vaisilaeli voha muni vamkita Lehoboamu avyayi nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Lukumbi lwenulo Yeloboamu mwana wa Nebati avili akona ku Misili tangia cheahambili peamutilayi Solomoni. Yeloboamu peayuwini genago akakiliwuka kuhuma ku Misili. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Nambu Vaisilaeli vakatuma ujumbi kumukemela Yelobohamu, kangi mwene pamonga na Vaisilaeli voha vakamuhambila Lehoboamu na kumujovela, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Dadi waku Solomoni atihengisi mahengu geginonopa. Hinu tikukuyupa utipunguzilayi mahengu aga geginonopa, na tete yati tikukuhengela.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Lehoboamu akavajovela, “Muhambayi mukatama magono gadatu na muniwuyilayi kavili.” Ndi vandu venavo vakahamba.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Mwanakandahi Lehoboamu akagana kulongela na vagogo vevamuhengili Solomoni dadi waki lukumbi peavili mumi, ndi akavakota, “Mukunishauli nivayangula kyani vandu venava?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Vagogo vakamuyangula, “Lelu ukayidakilayi kuvya mkulu wabwina wa vandu ava, ukalongelayi navu mbolimboli na ukavapelayi cheviyupa, ndi yati vivya vahengaji vaku vasadikika magono goha.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Lehoboamu akavevesa liyangulo la vagogo, nambu akavakota vasongolo va ntanga yaki vevamuhengelayi na akagahengela lihengu mayangulo gavi. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Akavakota, “Nyenye mwijova tivayangulayi wuli vandu ava vevanijovili nivapunguzilayi lihengu levapewili na dadi wangu?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Vasongolo venavo vakamuyangula, “Vandu venavo vevakujovili dadi waku avapelili mahengu geginonopa, vakakuyupa uvapunguzilayi mahengu genago, veve uvajovelayi naha, ‘Lungonji lwangu lweluvii ludebe ndi lukulupalili kuliku chiunu cha dadi wangu. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Dadi wangu avapelili mahengu geginonopa, nambu nene yati nikuvapela mahengu geginonopa neju. Dadi wangu avatovili kwa ndonga, nambu nene yati nikuvatova kwa ndonga yeyina minga!’”<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Ndi ligono la datu Yeloboamu pamonga na vandu voha vakakiliwuka kwa Lehoboamu ngati cheavajovili. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Nkosi akavevesa malovi geapewili na vagogo, akavayangula vandu venavo cha kuvalakalila. <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />Akalanda malovi ga vasongolo vayaki, akavajovela, “Dadi wangu avapelili mahengu geginonopa, nambu nene yati nikuvapela mahengu geginonopa neju. Dadi wangu avatovili kwa ndonga, nambu nene yati nikuvatova kwa ndonga yeyinaminga.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Bambu Chapanga amkitili nkosi akoto kuvayuwanila vandu venavo muni atimilisa linenu leamjovili Yeloboamu mwana wa Nebati kwa njila ya Ahiya wa ku Shiloni.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Nambu vandu voha va Isilaeli pevaweni kuvya nkosi abelili kuvayuwanila, vakaywanga na kumjovela, “Tivii lepi pamonga na Daudi mewa tina uhali lepi kuhuma kwa mwenuyo mwana wa Yese. Muwuya kunyumba nyenye mwavandu va Isilaeli! Veve chiveleku cha Daudi uyiyungayi nyumba yaku wamwene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:16">Penapo ndi vandu va Isilaeli vawuya kunyumba zavi.<verse eid="1KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Nambu vandu va Isilaeli vevatamayi ku miji wa Yuda, ndi venavo ndu vevasigalili muutalalila wa Lehoboamu.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Nkosi Lehoboamu amutumili Adolamu, mweavili kolokoloni mkulu wa mumahengu ga kung'ang'anisa ahamba kwa vandu voha va Isilaeli, nambu vakamutova maganga, vakamukoma. Na mwene Lehoboamu akakwela mutuka yaki ya kuhutwa na falasi, akatilalila ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Tangia penapo vandu va Isilaeli vitama cha umakoko na lukolo lwa Daudi mbaka lelu.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Vandu voha va pa Isilaeli pevayuwini kuvya Yeloboamu awuyili kuhuma ku Misili, vakamukemela palibanji la vandu voha, vakamukita avyayi nkosi wa pa Isilaeli poha. Kawaka likabila lelajiwungili na lukolo lwa Daudi nambu nga likabila la Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota wa Shemaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 11:1-4">2 Lus 11:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Lehobohamu peahikili pa Yelusalemu, akavakonganesa manjolinjoli vakekesi va makabila ga Yuda na Benjamini laki yimonga na elufu semanini, ndava ya kutovana na ulongosi wa pa Isilaeli, muni ahotolayi kuuwuyisa kangi unkosi kwa mwene Lehoboamu, mwana wa Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga akalongela na mlota Shemaya, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />na kumujovela, “Mjovela Lehoboamu mwana wa Solomoni, nkosi wa Yuda, na vandu voha va likabila la Yuda na la Benjamini, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />kuvya nene Bambu Chapanga nijova naha, ‘Mkotoka kuhamba, na mkotoka kutovana na valongo vinu, vandu va pa Isilaeli. Muwuyayi kila mundu ahamba kunyumba yaki, muni goha gegahumalili ndi gahumalili kwa kugana kwangu.’ ” Ndi vakaulanda ujumbi uwu wa Bambu Chapanga, vakawuya kavili kunyumba, ngati chevalagizwi na Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeloboamu akumng'anamukila Bambu Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Mwanakandahi nkosi Yeloboamu akajenga kangi muji wa Shekemu. Muji wenuwu uvi ku mlima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu, akatama kwenuko. Kangi akawuka na akahamba kujenga muji wa Penueli. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Yeloboamu akaholalela mumutima waki, “Hinu yihotoleka unkosi yati uwuya mu nyumba ya Daudi, <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />muni vandu ava yati viyendelela kuhamba kuwusa luteta kwa Bambu Chapanga ku Yelusalemu. Mitima yavi yati hikumuwuyila Lehoboamu bambu wavi nkosi wa ku Yuda, na vene yati vakunikoma nene.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Ndi pealongili na vandu vangi, akatengeneza himong'omong'o hivili ya mipapakasi ya ng'ombi yeyitenganizwi kwa zahabu. Kangi akavajovela vandu, “Nyenye mwavandu va Isilaeli, yeniyi ndi michapanga yinu yeyavawusili ku Misili! Kawaka chindu cha kutikita tihamba ku Yelusalemu tikawusa teta.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Chimong'omong'o chimonga cha zahabu akachivika ku muji wa Beteli na chingi akachivika ku muji wa Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Hinu vandu vamubudili Bambu Chapanga muni vahambili kuifugamila michapanga yeniyo ku Beteli na ku Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Mewawa Yeloboamu akajenga pandu pa kufugamilila kuhitumbi, akahagula vamteta kuhuma muvandu va namuna yoha, nambu lepi kuhuma kwa Valawi.<verse eid="1KI 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufugama ku Beteli kupewa likoto Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yeloboamu mewa akalagisa ligono la kumi na muhanu la mwehi wa nane uvya mselebuko ngati mselebuko wula wewakitikayi ku Yuda. Awusili teta ku pandu pa kuwusila teta peajengili ku Beteli palongolo ya hila himong'omong'o hivili ya mipapakasi yeahitenganizi, akavavika vamteta veavahagwili vala vahengelayi kila pandu pa kuwusila teta peatenganizi. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Ligono lenilo la kumi na muhanu la mwehi wa nane, lealihagwili mwene, akahamba ku Beteli kuwusa teta ku pandu peapatenganizi. Chenicho ndi cheakitili mselebuko wenuwo weauvikili ndava ya vandu va Isilaeli, na mwene akakwela kuhamba ku pandu pa kuwusila teta, na kuhukisa ubani.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Ligono limonga Yelobohamu ayimili pamuhana ya pandu pa kuwusila teta ku Beteli ndava ya kugana kuhukisa ubani. Ndi akamubwelela mundu wa Chapanga kuhuma ku Yuda agegili ujumbi wa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Mundu yula akajova chila cheajoviwi na Bambu Chapanga achijovayi, na mwene akakwesa lwami na kujova, “Veve pandu pa kuwusila teta, Bambu Chapanga ijova naha, ‘Yati ivelekewa mwana mweikemiwa Yosia kuhuma mu chiveleku cha Daudi, mwene yati akuvakoma vamteta vaviwusa luteta na kuhukisa ubani pandu penapa na majege ga vandu yati akugatinyisa panani yaku.’” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Mundu yula akawusa ulangisu ligono lilalila na kujova, “Wu ndi ulangisu weajovili Bambu Chapanga kuvya, pandu pa kuwusila teta yati pibomoka na malyenge gegavili panani yaki yati giyitika yati wimanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga alongili na nene.”<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Nkosi Yeloboamu peayuwini malovi genago ga mundu wa Chapanga ku Beteli ndava ya pandu pa kuwusila teta, akagololosela chiwoko chaki na kujova, “Mumkamulayi mundu mwenuyo!” Bahopo chiwoko chenicho cheachigolwisi chikagogodala, ahotwili lepi kavili kuchiwuyisa. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Mewa pandu pa kuwusila teta pakabomoka na malyenge gaki gakayitika pahi, ngati ulangisu weauwusili mundu wa Chapanga kwa malovi ga Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Penapo nkosi Yeloboamu akamujovela mundu wa Chapanga, “Chondi, uniyupilayi kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, chiwoko changu chilama kavili.” Na mwene mlota akamuyupa Bambu Chapanga, ndi chiwoko cha nkosi chikalama, chikavya bwina ngati pakutumbula.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Penapo nkosi akamujovela mundu wa Chapanga, “Tiyeni kunyumba yangu tikalyayi chakulya na nene yati nikukupela njombi ndava ya lijabu leunikitili.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Nambu mundu wa Chapanga akamujovela, “Hati ngati ukanipelayi yapinga ya vindu vyaku, nihamba lepi pamonga na veve. Yati nilya lepi wala kunywe manji pandu apa. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Muni Bambu Chapanga anilagisi nikotoka kulya chakulya wala kunywa manji, mewa nikiliwukayi kwa njila yingi, lepi yenikabwelili.” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Na awuyili lepi kwa njila yeabwelalili pa Beteli, nambu awuyili kwa njila yingi.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlota mgogolo wa pa Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili na mlota mmonga mgogolo wa pa Beteli. Vakamuhambila vana vaki na vakamukokosela mambu goha geahengili mundu wa Chapanga ligono lila, ku Beteli. Mewa vakamukokosela malovi gala mundu wa Chapanga geamujovili nkosi Yeloboamu. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Dadi wavi akavakota, “Awuyili kwa ndila yoki?” Na vene vakamulangisa njila yeapitili mundu wa Chapanga mweahumili ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Na mwene akavajovela vana vaki, “Munitandikilayi lipunda.” Na vene vakamutandikila lipunda na gogo akakwela panani yaki. <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Akamulanda mundu wa Chapanga yula. Akamukolela atamili pahi ya chikongo chechikemiwa mwaloni. Ndi akamukota, “Wu, veve ndi wa mundu wa Chapanga mweuhumili ku Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Na mwene akamuyangula, “Ena, ndi nene.”<verse eid="1KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Mlota mgogolo mwenuyo akamujovela, “Tihamba kunyumba yangu ukalya chakulya.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Nambu mwene akamujovela, “Nihotola lepi kuwuya pamonga na veve, wala kuyingila munyumba yaku. Nihotola lepi kulya chakulya amala kunywa manji pandu apa, <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />muni Bambu Chapanga anilagisi nikotoka kulya chakulya wala kunywa manji pandu apa, na nikotoka kukiliwuka kwa njila yenabwelalili.”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Mlota mgogolo wa ku Beteli akamujovela, “Nene mewa namulota ngati veve, na Bambu Chapanga alongili na nene kwa njila ya vamitumu vaki va kunani akajova, ‘Mkiliwusayi mwenuyu kunyumba yaku akalya chakulya na kunywa manji.’” Nambu mlota mgogolo amukongayi muyaki.<verse eid="1KI 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Ndi mundu wa Chapanga akakiliwuka pamonga nayu, akalya chakulya na akanywa manji kwa mlota mgogolo mwenuyo. <verse eid="1KI 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Pevavili vakona vilya, linenu la Bambu Chapanga likamubwelela mlota mgogolo, <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />na mwene akamujovela kwa lwami luvaha mundu wa Chapanga mweahumi ku Yuda, “Bambu Chapanga ijova naha, ‘Veve ulekili kulanda malagizu gaki, veve walandili lepi malagizu geakupelili Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Nambu ukiliwiki apa ulili chakulya na unywili manji pandu pewajoviwi ukotoka kulya chakulya wala ukotoka kunywa manji. Hinu, higa yaku yati yizikwa lepi kwevazikiwi vagogo vaku.’”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Pevamalili kulya, mlota mgogolo akamutendelekela lipunda mundu wa Chapanga kuhuma ku Yuda, ndi akahamba. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Lukumbi peahambayi, akakonganeka na lihimba munjila, likamukoma na higa yaki yikavya panjila, lipunda laki pamonga na lihimba vyayimili pamuhanna yaki. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Vandu pevapilitili penapo na kuyiwona higa yivii pahi panjila, na lihimba liyimili pamuhana ya higa yila, vakahamba mbaka kubomani kukokosa genago kwa vandu.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Mlota mgogolo yula mweamuwuyisi kuhuma mulugendu lwaki peayuwini genago, ndi akajova, “Mwenuyu ndi yulayula mundu wa Chapanga mweabelili kulanda linenu la Chapanga! Bambu Chapanga alitumili lihimba, limuzangili na kumukoma ngati cheamjovili.” <verse eid="1KI 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Penapo akavajovela vana vaki, “Munitendekelayi lipunda.” Na vene vakamutendelekela. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Mlota mgogolo yula akahamba akayikolela higa ya mundu wa Chapanga yula yivii panjila, lihimba na lipunda laki vivili pamuhana yaki, lihimba lenilo lalili lepi higa yila wala lalizangili lepi lipunda lila. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Penapo mlota mgogolo mwenuyo akayiwusa higa ya mundu wa Chapanga, akayivika panani ya lipunda laki, akaukiliwusa kumuji wa Beteli, kukita malilu na kumuzika. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Ndi akamzika mulitinda laki, mwene pamonga na mwana waki vakavembeneka ndava kufwa kwaki kuni vijova, “Yoyoo mulongo wangu! Mlongo wangu!” <verse eid="1KI 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Pevamalili kumzika, mlota mgogolo mwenuyo akavajovela vana vaki, “Nikafwayi, munizikayi mulitinda lilili leazikiwi mundu wa Chapanga, mahupa gangu gavya pamuhana ya mahupa gaki. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Mambu goha gealagiswi na Bambu Chapanga ndava ya pandu pa kuwusila teta ku Beteli, na pandu poha pa kuwusila teta kuhitumbi ya Samalia, chakaka yati gitimila.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhoka kwa kwekwakomakisi lukolo lwa Yeloboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Hati pegamali kuhumalila genago, Yeloboamu alekili lepi ubudanu waki, ayendalili kuvakita vandu vangaganikiwa vavyayi vamteta, vahengelayi pandu pa kuwusila teta kuhitumbi. Mundu yoyoha mweaganili kuvya mteta ndi amunyambisi avya mteta wa kutetela michapanga pandu pa kunani. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Chenicho ndi chewavili uhakahu wewavakitili vandu va lukolo lwa Yeloboamu vakomakeswayi.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwana wa Yeloboamu ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Abiya mwana wa nkosi Yeloboamu alwalayi. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Yeloboamu akamujovela mdala waki, “Wala nyula zingi muni ukoto kumanyikana kuvya veve wamdala wangu na uhambayi ku Shilo kweitama mlota Ahiya, mweajovili kuvya yati nivya nkosi wa pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Mpelekelayi mabumunda kumi pamonga na mambama, na wuchi libotolo limonga. Kamkota na akujovelayi gegakumuhumalila mwana witu.”<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Ndi mdala wa Yeloboamu akawuka na kuhamba kunyumba ya Ahiya ku muji wa Shilo. Lukumbi lwenulo, Ahiya ahotolayi lepi kulola bwina ndava ya ugogolo. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Bambu Chapanga amalili kumujovela Ahiya kuvya mdala wa Yeloboamu avii munjila ibwela kukukota kuvala mwana waki mtamu na goki gegakumkolelayi. Na Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Ahiya malovi geakumyangula mdala wa Yeloboamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:5">Mdala wa Yeloboamu peahikili, akajikita kuvya mundu yungi.<verse eid="1KI 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Ahiya peayuwini chigigi chiyingila pamulyangu, akajova, “Yingila mugati mudala wa Yeloboamu. Nambu ndava kyani ukujikita kuvya wamundu yungu? Nivii na ukokoso wewangavya wabwina kwaku. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Hamba ukamujovela Yeloboamu kuvya, Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ijova naha, ‘Nakuhagwili pagati ya vanndu, na kukukita uvyayi wa chilongosi wa vandu vangu va Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Nikaupapula unkosi uwuka kwa viveleku vya Daudi, nikakupela veve. Nambu veve uvii lepi ngati muhengaji wangu Daudi mweakamwili malagizu gangu, akakita genigana kwa mtima waki woha na kukita gegiganikiwa palongolo ya mihu gangu. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Veve uhengili uhakau uvaha neju kuliku vankosi voha vevakulongolili. Veve uniyomisi kwa kutengeneza michapanga hingi na himong'omong'o ya lufumbu kwa zahabu, kangi unilekili. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />Ndava ya lenili, yati nikuvaletela mang'aisu vandu va mu nyumba ya Yeloboamu, yati nikuvakoma vagosi voha va Isilaeli vevavii pamonga naku, mweavii mvanda amala mweangavya mvanda. Yati nikuvawusa vandu voha va Yeloboamu ngati mundu chaiyola mai mbaka gamalika. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Mlongo yoyoha wa Yeloboamu mweifwililayi pabomani, mabwa yati gakumlya, na yoyoha mweifwililayi kumigunda, hidege yati hikumuhonyola. Nene ndi Bambu Chapanga nijovili.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Ahiya akamjovela mdala wa Yeloboamu, “Hinu yinukayi uwuya ku nyumba yaku. Peuyingilayi ndu mu muji, msongolo waku yati ifwa. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Vandu voha yati vikita malilu na kumzika. Nambu nga yuyo ndu wa lukolo lwa Yeloboamu ndi mweizikwa, muni mwene ndu mu lukolo lwa Yeloboamu ndi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli achiweni chindu chabwina kuhuma kwaki. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />Kangi lelu iyi, Bambu Chapanga yati ivika nkosi yungi pa Isilaeli mweakuvakoma vandu va lukolo lwa Yeloboamu tangiya hinu. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuvabuna vandu va Isilaeli, na vene yati vinyugusika ngati linyahi chelinyuguswa kumfuleni. Yati akuvawusa pa mulima uwu wabwina weavapelili vagogo vavi, na kuvapechengana kutali, kumwambu ya mfuleni Efulati, muni vamuyomisi Bambu Chapanga kwa kujitengenezela vimong'omong'o vya Ashela mchapanga wa chidala. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuutaga mulima wa Isilaeli ndava ya kuhoka kwa Yeloboamu na kuvakita vandu va isilaeli vamubudila Chapanga.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Penapo mdala wa Yeloboamu akawuka, na kuwuya ku Tiliza. Nambu peahikili ndu pamulyangu, mwana waki akafwa. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Vandu voha va Isilaeli vakamzika msongolo yula na kukita malilu ngati cheajovili Bambu Chapanga kupitila mlota Ahiya, muhengaji waki.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeloboamu ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Mahengu gangi ga nkosi Yeloboamu, cheakomini ngondo na cheatalalili, goha gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso wa Vankosi va Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yeloboamu atalalili Isilaeli kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka ishilini na hivili, ndi akafwa na kuzikwa, na Nadabu mwana waki akavya nkosi wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkosi Lehoboamu wa ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 11:5-12:15">2 Lus 11:5-12:15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Lehobohamu mwana wa Solomoni avili na miyaka alubaini na umonga lukumbi peatumbwili kutalalila pa Yuda. Na mwene atalalili kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka kumi na saba pa Yelusalemu, mulima wewahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga pagati ya miji yoha ya makabila ga Isilaeli ndava vamuyupilayi mwenumo. Nyina waki Lehoboamu avili Naama kuhuma kwa Vaamoni.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Vandu va ku Yuda vahengili gahakahu palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Vamuyomisi kwa uhakahu wavi wavahengili wamahele kuliku wavahengili vagogo vavi. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Vajitenganizili mewa pandu pa kuwusila luteta na pandu pa kufugamilila michapanga hingi, na mapanda ga maganga na vimong'omong'o vya Ashela, kunani ya kila chitumbi chitali na pahi ya kila chikongo chivaha. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Kangi kwavili na fugama za ukemi kila pandu, vagosi na vadala vakitili mambu ga kuyomesa gegakitiki na vandu va milima hila yevavingiwi na Bambu Chapanga lukumbi Vaisilaeli pevayingilayi ku Kanaani.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Mumwaka wa muhanu wa utalalila wa Lehoboamu, Shishaki nkosi wa ku Misili, akauzangila muji wa Yelusalemu, <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Akavitola vindu vyoha vyevivikiwi chibana munyumba ya kumfugamilila Bambu Chapanga na vya munyumba ya chinkosi. Akatola vindu vyoha, pamonga na vingwamba vya zahabu vyevitenganizi na Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Pahala pa vingwamba vyenivyo, nkosi Lehoboamu akatengeneza vingwamba vya shaba na kuvivika viyangaliwayi na valonda va panyumba ya chinkosi. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Lukumbi lwoha nkosi peahambayi ku Nyumba ya Chapanga, valonda vagegayi vingwamba vyenivyo ndava ya kujidivalila, na mwanakandahi vavikiliwusayi pandu pa kuviyangalila.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Matendu gangi ga utalalila wa nkosi Lehoboamu na goha geahengili gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso wa Vankosi va Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Lukumbi lwoha kwavili na ngondo pagati ya Lehoboamu na Yeloboamu. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Lehoboamu akafwa na akazikwa pamatinda ga vagogo vaki, kumuji wa Daudi nyina waki akemiwi Naama msikana wa Maaka. Abiya mwana waki akavya nkosi pahala paki.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Abiya nkosi wa ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 13:1-14:1">2 Lus 13:1-14:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Abiya atumbwili kutalalila ku Yuda mu mwaka wa kumi na nane wa utalalila wa nkosi Yeloboamu, mwana wa Nebati, peatalalilayi Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Atalalili ku Yelusalemu kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka hidatu. Nyinawaki ndi avii Maaka msikana wa Abusalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Abiya akitili uhakahu wulawula weakitili dadi waki, avili lepi na mtima wa uchakaka kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waki, ngati cheavili Daudi gogo waki. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Pamonga na genago, Bambu Chapanga ampelili Abiya mwana mweitalalilayi pahala paki na kwakuyikita Yelusalemu yivyayi ngangali ndava ya Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Bambu Chapanga akitili chenicho ndava Daudi akitili gabwina palongolo yaki na alekili lepi kuhenga gealagiswi na Bambu Chapanga magono goha ga wumi waki, nambu ndu wula muhalu wa Ulia mweahumalili kwa Vahiti. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Lukumbi lwoha lwa Abiya kwavili na ngondo pagati ya unkosi wa Lehoboamu na unkosi wa Yeloboamu. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Matendu gangi ga Abiya na goha geahengili, gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso cha vankosi va Yuda, na lukumbi lwoha kwavili na ngondo pagati ya Abiya na Yeloboamu.<verse eid="1KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Na mwene Abiya akafwa na akazikwa pa Muji wa Daudi, na pahala paki atalalili Asa mwana waki.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asa nkosi wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 14:1-5">2 Lus 14:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:16">15:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Mu mwaka wa ishilini wa utalalila wa Yeloboamu, nkosi wa Isilaeli, Asa atubwili kutalalila ku Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />atalalili kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka alubaini na umonga. Nyina waki avili Maaka mwana wa Abusalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Nkosi Asa amkitili gabwina Bambu Chapanga, ngati cheakitili Daudi dadi waki. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Akavavinga pamulima vakemi voha vevakita ukemi pandu pa kuwusila teta pa himong'omong'o yavi, akahitaga himong'omong'o yoha vyevavikili vagogo vaki. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Asa akamuwusa Maaka nyina waki makakala geavili nagu ga kuvya ngati nyina wa nkosi, muni atenganizi chimong'omong'o cha Ashela cha kuyomesa. Ndi Asa akachidumula chimong'mongo chenicho na kuchitinyisa kwa motu mumuhana mwa mfuleni Kidiloni. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Pamonga kuvya apahalabisi lepi pandu pa panani pa kuwusila teta, nambu Asa avili msadika kwa Bambu Chapanga magono gaki goha. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Awuyisi mu Nyumba ya Chapanga vindu vyoha vyevyawusiwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga. Vindu vyevyavili vya madini ga feza na vya zahabu vyevyawusiwi na mwene pamonga na vadadi vaki.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Kwavili na ngondo pagati ya Asa nkosi wa Yuda na Baasha nkosi wa Isilaeli, mulukumbi lwoha lwa utalalila wavi. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Baasha nkosi wa Isilaeli akauzangila mulima wa Yuda na kuukita muji wa Yelusalemu uvya ngangali muni kudivalila vandu vakoto kuhuma na kuyingili mu mulima wa Yuda weitalalila Asa. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Ndi nkosi Asa akatola madini ga feza pamonga na zahabu zoha zezasigalili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga na mu nyumba yaitama nkosi, akavapela vahengaji vaki, na kuvajovela vahambayi ku Damasiko kwa Beni Hadadi mwana wa Tabilimoni mjukulu wa Hezioni nkosi wa ku Silia, vakamjovelayi, <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Tikitayi mapatanu pagati yaku na nene ngati chevakitili dadi wangu na dadi waku, lola nikuletili njombi ya madini ga feza na zahabu, hamba kadenyayi mapatanu gegavili pagati yaku na Baasha nkosi wa ku Isilaeli, muni alekayi kunizangila nene.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Penapo nkosi Benihadadi akayidakila luyupu lwa nkosi Asa na kuvatuma vakekesi va ngondo va misambi ya manjolinjoli gaki, vahambayi vakahibunayi miji ya Isilaeli. Navene vakahitola miji ya Iyoni na Dani na Abeli Beti Maaka na pandu poha papitindila nyanja Galilaya pamonga na mulima woha wa likabila la Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Nkosi Baasha peayuwini mambu ga ngondo yeniyo ndi akaleka kuukangamalisa muji wa Lama, na akahamba kutama ku Tilisa.<verse eid="1KI 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Penapo nkosi Asa akalagisa kwa vandu voha va ku Yuda, changali kumuleka hati mundu mmonga, vakatolayi maganga ku Lama pamonga na mbao, vindu vyeahengalili Baasha kujengela. Na mwene nkosi Asa akahengela vindu vyenivyo kujengela ku Mizipa na muji wa Geba weuvi mu mulima wa likabila la Benjamini.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Matendu gangi goha geahengili nkosi Asa na ukekesi waki na miji yoha yeahijengili, goha gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso cha Vankosi va Yuda. Nambu mulukumbi lwa ugogolo waki, Asa ang'aiswi na utamu wa magendelu. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Asa akafwa na vakamzika pamatinda ga chinkosi ku Muji wa Daudi, na Yehoshafati mwana waki akavya nkosi pahala paki.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nadabu nkosi wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Mu mwaka wa pili wa utalalila waki Asa ku Yuda, Nadabu mwana wa Yeloboamu, atumbwili kutalalila ku Isilaeli. Atalalili kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka hivili. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Nadabu akamkitila gahakahu Bambu Chapanga, kwa kukita ngati dadi waki cheamubudili Bambu Chapanga na kuvakita vandu va Isilaeli vakita gahakahu.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Baasha mwana wa Ahiya, wa likabila la Isakali, akakita mpangu uhakahu ndava ya Nadabu na kumkoma ku Gibetoni, muji wa Vafilisiti. Lukumbi Nadabu pamonga na manjolinjoli gaki pevauzangili muji wenuwo. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baasha akamkoma Nadabu mu mwaka wa datu wa utalalila wa Asa nkosi wa ku Yuda, na mwene Baasha akavya nkosi wa ku Isilaeli pahala pa Nadabu. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Lukumbi ndu peatumbwili kutalalila, Baasha akavakoma vandu voha va lukolo lwa Yeloboamu, amulekili lepi hati mundu mmonga. Yakitiki chenicho ngati cheajovili Bambu Chapanga kupitila Ahiya, muhengaji waki wa ku Shilo. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Mambu genago gahengiki ndava Yeloboamu amuyomisi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, kwa kubuda kwaki na ndava ya kuvakita Vaisilaeli vavya vabudanu.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Matendu gangi goha ga Nadabu, gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso cha Vankosi va Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Asa nkosi wa ku Yuda na Baasha nkosi wa ku Isilaeli vavili na ngondo pagati yavi lukumbi lwoha lwa utalalila wavi.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baasha nkosi wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Mu mwaka wa datu wa utalalila wa Asa nkosi wa ku Yuda, Baasha mwana wa Ahiya ndi akavya nkosi wa Isilaeli yoha ku Tilisa, na mwene ndi akatalalila kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka ishilini na mcheche. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Baasha akamkitila gahakahu Bambu Chapanga, ngati cheakitili Yeloboamu dadi waki mweambudili Bambu Chapanga na kuvakita vandu va Isilaeli vakita gahakau kwa Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Linenu la Bambu Chapanga likamubwelela Yehu mwana wa Hanani, muni amjovela Baasha kuvya, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Veve Baasha wavili mundu wangamanyikana, nakuyinwili na kukukita uvya chilongosi wa vandu vangu va Isilaeli. Veve umuyigili Yeloboamu, ukavakita vandu vangu va Isilaeli vakitayi gahakahu na kuniyomesa kwa kubuda kwavi. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Hinu yati nikukukomakesa veve pamonga na valongo vaku voha, yati nikuvakitila vandu vaku ngati chenavakitili vandu va Yeloboamu mwana wa Nebati. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Mundu yoyoha pagati ya valongo vaku mweifwilila kubomani, mabwa yati gakumulya, na yoyoha mweifwilila ku mugunda yati ihonyolewa na videge.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Matendu gangi goha geahengili Baasha pamonga na ukekesi waki, gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso cha Vankosi va Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Baasha akafwa akazikwa ku Tiliza. Ela mwana waki akavya nkosi pahala paki.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Linenu la Chapanga likamubwelela kavili Baasha pamonga na vandu vaki kupitila mlota Yehu mwana wa Hanani, ndava ya uhakahu weamkitili Bambu Chapanga. Baasha akamuyomesa Bambu Chapanga ndava ya mambu gaki, muni akitili uhakau ngati cheakitili Yeloboamu na ndava ya kuvakoma vandu voha va munyumba ya Yeloboamu.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela nkosi wa ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Mumwaka wa ishilini na sita wa utalalila wa Asa nkosi wa ku Yuda, Ela mwana wa Baasha, atumbwili kutalalila ku Isilaeli kuni itama ku Tiliza kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka hivili. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Zimli mweavili muhengaji waki mweayimamila yapinga ya mutuka za ngondo za kuhutwa na falasi za nkosi, akakita mpangu uhakahu wa kumukoma Ela. Ligono limonga Ela avili ku Tiliza, anywayi na kugala munyumba ya Alisa. Alisa avili muyimamila wa nyumba ya chinkosi. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Zimli akayingila mugati akamukoma Ela. Kangi Zimli akatalalila pahala paki Ela. Genago gahumalili mu mwaka wa isilini na saba wa utalalila wa Asa nkosi wa ku Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Peatumbwili ndu kutalalila, Zimli avakomili vandu voha va Baasha, amulekili lepi hati mugosi mumonga pagati ya vandu vaki, hati ngati avi mlongo amala mkozi wa Baasha. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Penapo Zimli akavakoma vandu voha va Baasha, ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamjovili Baasha kupitila mlota Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Mambu genago gahengiki ndava ya uhakahu weahengili Baasha na Ela mwana waki. Vamuyomisi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, kwa kukita gahakahu na kuvakita vadu va Isilaeli vakitayi gahakahu ndava ya kuifugamila michapanga ya himong'omong'o yavi. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Matendu gangi goha geahengili Ela mu utalalila waki, gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso cha Vankosi va Isilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zimli nkosi wa ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Mumwaka wa ishilini na saba wa utalalila wa Asa nkosi wa ku Yuda, Zimli atumbwili kutalalila ku Isilaeli kuni itama ku Tiliza, atalalili kwa lukumbi lwa magono saba. Lukumbi lwenulo manjolinjoli va Isilaeli vavikili kambi kuutindila muji wa Gibetoni wa Vafilisiti. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Manjolinjoli va Isilaeli pevayuwini kuvya Zimli akitili mpangu na akamukoma nkosi, ndi voha vakamunyambisa Omili mweavili chilongosi wa manjolinjoli, avya nkosi ligono lilolo. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Penapo Omili pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki vakawuka ku Gibetoni, vakahamba kuuzangila muji wa Tiliza. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Zimli peaweni kuvya muji uzangiwi, akayingila mu chumba cha mugati cha munyumba ya chinkosi, akayiyocha motu na mwene akafwilila mumo. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Yakitiki chenicho ndava ya uhakahu weamkitili Bambu Chapanga, muni akitili uhakau ngati cheakitili Yeloboamu na kuvakita vandu va Isilaeli vakita uhakahu. <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Matendu gangi goha geahengili Zimli na mpangu weakitili, gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso cha Vankosi va Isilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omili nkosi wa ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Penapo vandu va pa Isilaeli vakajigava vakavya misambi hivili, msambi umonga ukagana Tibini mwana wa Ginati avya nkosi na msambi wungi ukagana Omili ayendelelayi kuvya nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Nambu ukahotola msambi wewaganili Omili avya nkosi, muni wavili na makakala neju kuliku vala vevaganayi Tibini mwana wa Ginati avya nkosi, Tibini akafwa na Omili akavya nkosi. <verse eid="1KI 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Omili akatumbula kutalalila mumwaka wa selasini na umonga wa utalalila wa Asa nkosi wa ku Yuda. Atalalili kwa lukummbi lwa miyaka kumi na hivili, miyaka sita atalalilayi kuni itama ku Tiliza. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Pa genago, achigulili chitumbi cha Samalia kwa hipandi elufu sita ya madini ga feza kuhuma kwa mundu mmonga mweikemiwa Shemeli, panani yaki akajenga lindanda na muji. Akaukemela muji wenuwo Samalia, ndava ya kumtopesa Shemeli mweatumbwili kutama pa chitumbi chenicho.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Omili ambudili Bambu Chapanga, akitili gahakahu neju kuliku vankosi voha vevamulongolili. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Muni akitili uhakau ngati cheakitili Yeloboamu mwana wa Nebati, akamuyomesa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, kwa kuvakita vandu va Isilaeli vabuda kwa kufugamila michapanga ya himong'omong'o. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Matendu gangi goha geakitili Omili na ukekesi waki, gayandikwi mu Chitabu cha Ukumbuso wa Vankosi va Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Omili akafwa, akazikwa ku Samalia, na Ahabu mwana waki akavya nkosi pahala paki.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahabu nkosi wa ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Mu mwaka wa selasini na nane wa utalalila wa Asa nkosi wa ku Yuda, Ahabu mwana wa Omili akavya nkosi wa ku Isilaeli kwa miyaka ishilini na hivili kuni itama ku Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Ahabu mwana wa Omili akamkitila gahakahu Bambu Chapanga kuliku vankosi voha vevamulongolili. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Kangi pamonga na kukita uhakau neju ngati cheakitili Yeloboamu mwana wa Nebati, uhakahu wa Ahabu wayonjosiki neju ndava ya kumgega Yezebeli msikana wa Etibaali nkosi wa ku Sidoni, na kutumbula kuufugamila mchapanga Baali. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Akajenga nyumba ya kumfugamila mchapanga Baali ku Samalia, na mugati yaki ajengili pandu pa kuwusila teta. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Mewa atenganizi na chimong'omong'o cha Ashela mchapanga wa chidala. Ahabu akitili gahakahu gamahele kuliku vankosi voha va pa Isilaeli vevamulongolili. Ahabu akamuyomesa neju Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Lukumbi lwa utalalila wa Ahabu, Hieli kuhuma ku Beteli, aujengili kavili muji wa Yeliko. Lukumbi lwa kuivika mikingisu ya Yeliko, Hieli akafiwa na mwana waki mgosi wa kutumbula mweikemiwa Abilamu, na lukumbi lwa kuvika mamilyangu gaki, akafiwa kangi na mwana waki mgosi wa mwishu mweikemiwa Segubu. Genago goha gahumalili kuwanangana na linenu la Bambu Chapanga lelabwelili kupitila Yoshua mwana wa Nuni.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga akumpela chakulya Eliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Hinu mlota Eliya wa chijiji cha Tishibe uko ku Gileadi, akamujovela nkosi Ahabu, “Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli mweavii mumi mwenikumufugamila nene, yatikuvya lepi na mbetu amala fula kutumbula hinu mbaka penijova nene.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Bambu Chapanga likamubwelela Eliya kuvya, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Wuka penapa hamba ku upandi welihumila lilanga, ukajihiha pakapela ka Keliti kekavii kwelihumila lilanga mwa mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Kwenuko yati winywa manji ga kapela kenako, na mewa nigalagisi makungulu gakuletela chakulya kwenuko.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Penapo Eliya akakita ngati chealagiswi na Bambu Chapanga, akahamba kutama mumihana ya kapela ka Kelithi kekavii kuupandi welihumila lilanga wa mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Lukela na chimihi makungulu gamuletelayi libumunda na nyofu, na anywayi manji mukapela kenako. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Nambu mumagono gadebe ndu kapela kakayuma muni fula yatonyayi lepi pamulima.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliya na lipwela wa ku Salefati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Penapo Bambu Chapanga akamjovela mlota Eliya na kujova, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Uhamba kubomani ya Salefati, papipi na Sidoni, ukatama kwenuko. Nimulagisi mudala mumonga lipwela akupela chakulya kwenuko.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Ndi Eliya akawuka, akahamba ku Salefati. Peahikili pamulyangu wa muji, amukolili mdala mumonga lipwela inonga sagala. Eliya akamukemela mdala mwenuyo na kumujovela, “Niyupa unipela manji ga kunywa.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Mdala yula peahambayi, Eliya akamujovela, “Niyupa uniletelayi na chipadi cha libumunda.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Mdala mwenuyo akamujovela, “Nikulapila kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku mweavii mumi, nina libumunda lepi hati lidebe. Vyenivii navyu ndi uhembe wa kuteleka mala yimonga na tumahuta chidogo mulibotolo. Nibwelili peapa kunonga sagala na kuwuya kunyumba nikatelekayi tilyayi nene na mwana wangu na tilindila kufwa.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya akamjovela, “Kotoka kuyogopa. Hamba kakita ngati cheujovili. Nambu unitengenezela nene hoti na uniletelayi chipandi cha libumunda, kangi ndi mujitengenezelayi chakulya veve na mwana waku. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Muni Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli ijova naha, ‘Uhembe weuvii muchiviga chaku yati upungula lepi mewa na mahuta gegavii mugati ya libotolo yati gipunguka lepi, mbaka nene Chapanga penitonyesa fula pamulima.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Hinu lipwela mwenuyo akahamba kukita ngati cheajoviwi na Eliya. Ndi kukavya na chakulya cha Eliya, mau yula pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaki magono gamahele. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Uhembe wamaliki lepi muchiviga wala mahuta gapungwiki lepi mulibotolo kulandana na linenu la Bambu Chapanga leamjovili Eliya ajovayi.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Pagapitili magono gadebe, mwana wa lipwela yula akalwala, akavya mulung'olelu, na pamwisu akafwa. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Mdala yula akamkota Eliya, “Veve wamundu wa Chapanga una kyani na nene? Kumbi wabwelili kwangu ndava ya kunimanyisa uhakahu wangu, na kuleta lifwa la mwana wangu?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya akamuyangula, “Nipela mwana waku.”Ndi Eliya akamutola mwana mwenuyo kuhuma mumawoko ga nyina waki, akahamba naku kuchumba chaki kudali, akamvika panani ya chitanda chaki. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Ndi akamuvembela kwa lwami luvaha Bambu Chapanga kwa kumujovela, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, wu, hati na mudala uyu mwenitama kwaki, mweakunivika mumi, ukumuletela msolo wa kumukoma mwana waki?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Kangi Eliya akajigonesa panani ya higa ya mwana mwenuyo mala zidatu kuni akumuyupa Bambu Chapanga, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, muwuyisilayi mwana uyu wumi waki!” <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Bambu Chapanga akayuwanila kuyupa lwa Eliya, mwana akatumbula kukeka kangi.<verse eid="1KI 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya akamuwuyisa mwana pahi kwa nyina waki, akamujovela, “Lola! Mwana waku avii mumi!”<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Lipwela mwenuyo akamujovela Eliya, “Hinu nimanyili chakaka kuvya veve ndi wamundu wa Chapanga na malovi geakupelili Bambu Chapanga ugajovayi ndi gachakaka.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Eliya na vamlota va chapanga Baali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Pegapitili magono gamahele, mumwaka wa datu tangia fula peyalekili kutonya, Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Eliya, kujova, “Hamba ukajilangisayi kwa nkosi Ahabu, penapo na nene yati nitonyesa fula.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Ndi Eliya akahamba kujilangisa kwa Ahabu. Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili na njala neju ku Samalia.<verse eid="1KI 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Mwene Ahabu akamkemela Obadia myimamila wa nyumba ya chinkosi. Obadia avili mundu mweakumfugamila neju Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Lukumbi Yezebeli peavakomili vamlota va Bambu Chapanga, Obadia avatolili vamlota miya yimonga akavahiha mumagodi gavili na kila ligodi vamlota amusini, avapelekelayi chakulya na manji. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Kangi Ahabu akamujovela Obadia, hamba ukalondayi pepavii na vikapela na pepavii na vinyepa mugati ya mulima wuwuwu, “Pangi yati tipata manyahi na penapo yati tikuhisangula falasi na punda falasi zitu.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Ndi vakagavana ndima yevaganayi kulonda manyahi, Ahabu akahamba upandi umonga na Obadia akahamba kuupandi wungi.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Lukumbi Obadia peavili munjila, akakonganeka na Eliya. Obadia akamumanya kuvya ndi Eliya akamugundamila mbaka pahi na kumkota, “Wu, ndi chakaka kuvya veve wa bambu wangu Eliya?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Eliya akamuyangula, “Ena, ndi nene, hamba ukamujovela bambu waku Ahabu kuvya, ‘Nene Eliya avii baha.’”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Obadia akamukota, “Wu, nibudi kyani, mbaka ugana nene nikomiwa na Ahabu? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku mweavii mumi, nkosi avatumili vandu vakulondayi mumilima yoha. Lukumbi lwoha nkosi amala vandu va mulima nunuyu vakajovayi timuweni lepi kuni Ahabu avakitili valapayi kuvya chakaka vakuweni lepi. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Na veve hinu ukunijovela nihamba kwa bambu wangu nikamujovelayi kuvya veve uvii apa! <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Na nene nimanyili lepi Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga kweakupeleka nene paniwuka pandu penapa. Nikahamba na kumjovela Ahabu kuvya veve uvi penapa akabwelayi na kubela kukukolela yati akunikoma. Pamonga na naha nene namuhengaji waku nimufugamili Bambu Chapanga tangia usongolo wangu. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Wu, wayuwini lepi kuvya nakitili kiki lukumbi Yezebeli peakomayi vamlota va Bambu Chapanga? Navahihili vamlota va Bambu Chapanga miya yimonga mumalindi gavili, hamusini mukila lilindi, na nene navapelekelayi chakulya na manji. <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Hinu veve ukunijovela nihambayi kwa bambu wangu nikamujovela, ‘Eliya avii apa.’ Mwene yati akunikoma!”<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya akajova, “Nikulapila kwa Bambu Chapanga Mweavi na Makakala, mwene mwenikumuhengela, chakaka lelu yati nikujilangisa kwa Ahabu.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Ndi Obadia akahamba kukonganeka na Ahabu na kumujovela kuvya Eliya awonikini, na mwene Ahabu akahamba kukonganeka na Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Ahabu peamuweni Eliya ndi akamujovela, “Wu, veve ndi mweukuvang'aha Vaisilaeli?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Eliya akamuyangula, “Pehe! nene lepi mwenikuvang'aha Vaisilaeli. Nambu veve na vandu va dadi waku ndi mwemukitili chenicho. Mugalekili malagizu ga Bambu Chapanga na mukalanda michapanga Mabaali. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Hinu vakemelayi vandu kuhuma pa Isilaeli yoha tikonganekayi pa chitumbi Kalimeli. Mewawa na veve uvaletayi vamlota va mchapanga Baali miya mcheche na hamusini na venavo vamlota va mchapanga wa chidala mweikemiwa Asheli miya mcheche, vevilya chakulya pamonga na Malikia Yezebeli.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Penapo ndi Ahabu akatuma ujumbi vakemelewayi vandu pa Isilaeli yoha pamonga na vamlota venavo panani ya chitumbi Kalimeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Eliya akayima palongolo ya vandu na kuvajovela, “Ndali yati muhamula kuvya yani ndi Chapanga winu? Yikavyayi Bambu Chapanga ndi Chapanga winu, mumulandayi mwenuyo nambu yikavyayi Baali ndi Chapanga winu, ndi mumulanda mwene.” Nambu vandu vayangwili lepi chindu. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Kangi Eliya akavajovela, “Ndi nene ndu namlota wa Bambu Chapanga mwenisigalili, nambu vamlota va mchapanga Baali vavii miya mcheche na hamusini. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Muleta ng'ombi zigosi zivili. Na vene vajihagulila ng'ombi yimonga, vayihinja na kuyidumula hipandi hipandi na vavika panani ya sagala nambu vakotoka kupambika motu. Na nene yati nikuyitendekela yeyisigalili na kuyivika panani ya sagala, mewa yati nipambika lepi motu. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Kangi mulikemelayi liina la bambu chapanga winu, na nene yati nikulikemela liina la Bambu Chapanga wangu, yula mweiyangulayi kwa motu, mwenuyo ndi Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Kangi vandu voha vakajova, “Laujovili ili ndi labwina.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Eliya akavajovela vamlota va mchapanga Baali, “Muhagulayi ng'ombi yigosi yimonga pagati ya ihii hivili na mutumbula nyenye kuyitendekeha, muni nyenye muvi mwavamahele neju. Mumkemela chapanga winu nambu mukotoka kupambika motu.”<verse eid="1KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Hinu vamlota va mchapanga Baali vakahagula ng'ombi yigosi yimonga na kuyitendekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:26">Kangi vakatumbula kumkemela mchapanga Baali tangia lukela mbaka chimihi, kuni vihumbahumba na kutindila pandu pa kuwusila teta kuni vijova, “Vee Baali utiyangulayi!” Nambu mchapanga Baali avayangwili lepi chindu.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Lukumbi lwa muhi, Eliya akatumbula kuvavevesa, kuni ijova, “Mkwesa lwami neju! Chakaka mwene ndi chapanga! Pangi avii mumaholo geginonopa, amala ahambili kutunda, amala ahambi pandu. Pangi agonili lugono lyoo, na mwene yiganikiwa ayimuswayi.” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Penapo ndi vakayongesa lwami na ngati cheyivili mivelu yavi, vakajidumudumula kwa kutumila hipula na hijembe, mbaka ngasi zikavahulula. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Vakayendelela kumkemela mchapanga Baali mbaka muhi lukumbi lwa kuwusa teta, nambu kawaka mweavayangwili na chahumalili lepi chindu chochoha.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Kangi Eliya akavajovela vandu voha, “Munihegelela nene papipi.” Vandu voha vakamuhegelela, na mwene akatendekeha pandu pa kuwusila teta pa Bambu Chapanga, pala pepadenyiwi. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Eliya akatola maganga kumi na gavili, kila liganga limonga ndava ya likabila limonga la vana va Yakobo. Bambu Chapanga amjovili Yakobo, “Liina laku yati ukemiwa Isilaeli.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Kwa kutumila maganga genago akajenga pandu pa kuwusila luteta lwa Bambu Chapanga, na akagima mfeleji kutindila pandu penapo pepana uvaha wa kuyingila manji lita kumi na mcheche. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Akapanga sagala pandu pa kuwusila teta, akayidumula ng'ombi yila hipandi hipandi na akavipanga panani ya sagala. Kangi akavajovela, “Mmemesa manji mumapipa mcheche na mugayitayi panani ya sagala na panani ya teta.” <verse eid="1KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Akavajovela, “Mukita chenicho kavili.” Na vene vakakita chenicho kavili. Akalagisa, “Mukitayi kwa mala ya datu.” Na vene vakakita chenicho kwa mala ya datu. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Manji gagendili pahi kutindila pandu pa kuwusila luteta na kuumemesa mfeleji.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Lukumbi lwa kuwusa teta ya muhi, mlota Eliya akahegelela palongolo ya pandu pa kuwusila teta na kuyupa, kuni ijova, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa vadadi vitu Ibulahimu na Isaka na Isilaeli, yimanyikanayi lelu kuvya veve ndi wa Chapanga pagati ya Isilaeli na ya kuvya nene ndi namuhengaji waku na nihengili mambu aga goha ndava unilagizi nikita chenicho. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Uniyangulayi nene, veve Bambu Chapanga, niyangulayi nene, ndava vandu ava vamanyayi kuvya veve ndi Bambu Chapanga, na kuvya ukuying'anamusa mitima yavi hikuwuyilayi kavili.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Penapo Bambu Chapanga akahelesa motu na kuyitinyisa teta yila na sagala zila na maganga gala na ludaka lula na mewa ukayumisa manji gala gegavili mumfeleji. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Vandu voha pevaliweni lenili, vakagwa cha kukupama na kuvemba, “Bambu Chapanga, mwene ndi Chapanga! Bambu Chapanga mwene ndi Chapanga!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Kangi Eliya akavalagiza vandu, “Muvakamulayi vamulota voha va mchapanga Baali. Mukotoka kumuleka hati mumonga atoloka!” Vakavakamula, na mwene Eliya akavaleta mbaka pa kapela ka Kishoni na kuvahinja kwenuko.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukumbi lwa kubela kuvya na hula lumalika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Eliya akamujovela Ahabu, “Hamba ukalyayi na kunywa, muni kuvii na lwami lwa hula yamahele.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Penapo Ahabu akawuka na kuhamba kulya na kunywa. Nambu Eliya akakwela kuchituvilu cha chitumbi Kalimeli, akafugama na kugundama mbaka pahi, mutu waki akauvika pagati ya mafugamilu gaki. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Akamujovela muhengaji waki, “Hamba ukalola kuupandi wa nyanja.” Muhengaji yula akahamba na kulola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Akajova, “Kawaka chindu kwenuko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Eliya amtumili mtumisi waki mala saba, akajova, “Hamba kalolayi.”<verse eid="1KI 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Muhengaji waki peahambili mala ya saba, akabwela na kumujovela, “Lihundi lidebe ngati chiwoko cha mundu likwela lihumila kunyanja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Eliya akajova, “Hamba ukamujovela Ahabu, ‘Atendekeha mutuka yaki ya ngondo ya kuhutwa na falasi ahelelayi kwakona hula yangakudivalila.’”<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Lukumbi lulalula kunani kukavya na lihundi la fula, kukavya na mpungu na hula yivaha yikatonya, na mwene Ahabu akakwela mutuka yaki ya ngondo ya kuhutwa na falasi na kuhamba ku Yezileeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Makakala ga Bambu Chapanga gakamuyingila Eliya, na mwene akakangamala, akakunga bwina nyula yaki, akajumba palongolo ya mutuka ya ngondo yakuhutwa na falasi ya Ahabu munjila yoha mbaka pevahikili pa kuyingalila mu Yezileeli.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Elia itilalila ku chitumbi Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Ahabu akamjovela mdala waki mweikemiwa Yezebeli, kila chindu cheakitili Eliya, na chila chaavakomili vamulota voha kwa upanga. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Penapo Yezebeli akatuma ujumbi kwa Eliya akamjovela, “Nilapa yati nikukukoma. Mbaka chilau lukumbi ngati ulu ngati yikavya nangakita chenichi, ndi michapanga yinikoma.” <verse eid="1KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Eliya akayogopa, na akatila ndava ya kuusangula wumi waki. Akamtola mmonga wa vatumisi vaki akahamba nayu ku Beeli Sheba mu Yuda, akamuleka muhengaji waki kwenuko.<verse eid="1KI 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />Nambu Eliya akagenda lugendu lwa ligono loha mulugangatu. Akahika pachikongo chechikemiwa mletemu, akayima na kutama pahi yaki na kuyupa muni afwayi. Akajova, “Hinu yikolili, Bambu Chapanga, wusa wumi wangu, mbanga nifwa, ndava muni nene namubwina lepi ngati vadadi vangu.”<verse eid="1KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Kangi akajigoneka na kugona lugono. Baho mtumu wa kunani akamupamisa na kumujovela, “Yimuka, ulye.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Akalolokesa pandi zoha, na penapo papipi na mutu waki kwavili na libumunda leliyochwili pamotu wa makalakala na libotolo la manji. Akalya na kunywa, na akagona kavili. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Mtumu wa Bambu Chapanga yula akabwela kangi, akampamisa akamujovela, “Yimukayi ulyayi, nambu ngati ukabela kulya lugendu lwaku yati luvya lwelunonopa.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Ndi akayimuka, akalya na kunywa. Chakulya chila chikamupela makakala, akagenda lugendu lwa magono alubaini muhi na kilu mbaka akahika ku chitumbi cha Chapanga chechikemiwa Sinai. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Kwenuko akayingila muligodi, akagona mwenumo kilu yeniyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Bahopo Bambu Chapanga akamjovela, “Eliya, ukita kyani peapa?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Eliya akayangula, “Nijiwusili kukuhengela veve ndu Bambu Chapanga mweana makakala goha. Vandu va Isilaeli valibelili Lilaganu laku, vadenyili pandu paku pa kuwusila luteta na kuvakoma vamlota vaku kwa upanga. Nga nene namwene mwenisigalili, na hinu vakunilonda muni vanikoma.”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Bambu Chapanga akajova, “Huma kuvala ukayima panani ya chitumbi palongolo yangu, muni nene Bambu Chapanga nipita penapo.” Kangi Bambu Chapanga akapita na upepu wamahele weuvi na makakala ukabwela na kubayula hidunda hila na kudenyadenya matalau. Nambu Bambu Chapanga avili lepi mu upepu wenuwo. Upepu pewamaliki, kukavya na mndendemu wa ndima. Nambu Bambu Chapanga avili lepi mumndendemo wula. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Pewamaliki mndendemo wa ndima, kukavya na motu, nambu Bambu Chapanga avili lepi mu motu wula. Pewamaliki motu, lukabwela lwami lwa pahi lwa kupwepa.<verse eid="1KI 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Eliya peayiyuwini, akagubika pamihu paki kwa nyula yaki, akahuma na kuyima pamulomo wa ligodi. Kangi lwami lula lukamujovela, “Eliya, ukita kyani penapa?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Eliya akayangula, “Nijiwusili kukuhengela veve ndu Bambu Chapanga mweuvi na makakala goha. Vandu va Isilaeli valibelili Lilaganu laku, vadenyili pandu paku pa kuwusila luteta na kuvakoma vamlota vaku kwa upanga. Nga nene namwene mwenisigalili, na hinu vakunilonda muni vanikoma.”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela, “Wuya kwa njila yeukayibwelalili, uhamba kulugangatu lwa Damasiki. Lukumbi peuhika kwenuko, mnyala mahuta Hazaeli avya nkosi wa Silia. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Mewa mnyala mahuta Yehu mwana wa Nimshi avya nkosi wa Isilaeli, na umunyala mahuta Elisha mwana wa Shafati kuhuma ku Abeli Mehola avya mlota pahala paku. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Yehu yati akumukoma yoyoha mweitila upanga wa Hazaeli, na mwene Elisha yati akumukoma yoyoha mweitila upanga wa Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Hati hinu nivikili vandu elufu saba pa Isilaeli, vala voha vevangamyupa na kumfugamila mchapanga Baali, amala kubusu chimong'omong'o chaki.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha ikemiwa avya mtangatila wa Eliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Eliya akawuka penapo, palongolo akamkolela Elisha mwana wa Shafati. Alimayi kwa ng'ombi ishilini na mcheche, zezalimayi zivili, na mwene azilongosayi ng'ombi zivili za mwishu. Eliya akapita papipi naku, akahula lijoho laki na kumuwalika Elisha. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Penapo Elisha akazileka ng'ombi zaki, akamlanda Eliya, na akamujovela, “Nileka nikavalaga dadi wangu na nyina wangu, ndi yati nilandana na veve.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Elia akayangula, “Hambayi, nikubesa lepi.”<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Ndi Elisha akamuleka Eliya, na mwene akakiliwuka. Akatola ng'ombi zaki za kulimila akazihula mangolingoli na akazihinja. Akatola mangolingoli na kugabayula kuvya sagala za kutelekela nyofu, akavapela vandu na vene vakalya. Kangi akawuka, akamulanda Eliya na kutumbula kumuhengela.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Vandu va ku Silia vitovana ngondo na va Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Beni Hadadi nkosi wa ku Silia akavavika pamonga manjolinjoli vaki voha. Kuni ilandana na vankosi selasini na vevakweli falasi na mutuka za ngondo, vakahamba kuuzangila muji Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Akavatuma vajumbi kumuji wa Isilaeli kwa nkosi Ahabu, kujova, “Nkosi Beni Hadadi ijova naha, <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‘Nipela madini gaku ga feza na zahabu ndi vyangu, nipela na vadala vaku na vana vaku voha ndi vangu.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Nkosi wa Isilaeli akayangula, “Yivyayi ngati cheujova wa bambu wangu nkosi. Nene pamonga na vyoha vyenivii navyu ndi vyaku.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Vajumbi vala vakawuya kavili kwa Ahabu na kujova, “Chenichi ndi cheijova nkosi Benihadadi, ‘Nitumili ujumbu kujova nipela madini ga feza na zahabu na vadala vaku na vana vaku. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Nambu chilau lukumbi ngati ulu, yati nikuvatuma vatumisi vangu, vabwela kwaku kuyisakula nyumba yaku ya chinkosi, na nyumba za vilongosi vevavii pahi yaku. Yati vitola chochoha chabwina cheuvinachu.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Nkosi wa Isilaeli akavakemela vilongosi vagogo voha va pamulima na akavajovela, “Mulola mundu uyu cheavii na luhonda! Lukumbi peatumili apelekewayi vadala vangu na vana vangu na madini ga feza na zahabu zangu, nene namubelalili lepi.”<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Vagogo na vandu voha vakayangula, “Kotoka kumuyuwanila, na kotoka kukita cheigana.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Penapo Ahabu akavayangula vajumbi va Benihadadi, “Mumjovelayi bambu wangu nkosi, ‘Muhengaji waku yati nikita ndu gala gewaganili pa kutumbula, nambu ili lewigana hinu yati nihotola lepi kulikita.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:9">Vajumbi vala vakawuka na kupeleka liyangulo kwa Benihadadi.<verse eid="1KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Benihadadi akamutumila Ahabu ujumbi uwu, kujova, “Michapanga hinikomayi ngati yati nikuyikomakesa lepi njwe muji wa Samalia, na kuleka lububu lwa kumema mumawoko ga vandu vangu vevakunilanda.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Nkosi Ahabu akayangula, “Mumjovela nkosi Benihadadi, ‘Linjolinjoli mweihamba kungondo akotoka kujilumba, nambu ajilumba lukumbi peiwuya kuhuma kungondo.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Benihadadi ayuwini mayangulo genago lukumbi mwene na vankosi vanywayi mulindanda lavi, ndi akavalagisa manjolinjoli vaki, “Mujitendekehayi kuuzangila muji wa Samalia.” Ndi vakajitendekeha kuutova muji wenuwo.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Lukumbi lulalula mlota mmonga akambwelela Ahabu nkosi wa Isilaeli na kukokosa, “Chenichi ndi cheijova Bambu Chapanga, ‘Wu, uwona manjolinjoli ava chevavi vamahele? Lelu yati nikukita uvatova, na veve ndi yati umanya kuvya nene ndi Bambu Chapanga.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Ahabu akakota, “Ndi yani mweakugakita genaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Mlota akamuyangula, “Bambu Chapanga ijova naha, ‘Kwa utangatila wa manjolinjoli vasongolo vevavii pahi ya vakulu va wilaya yati vikita lenili.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Nkosi Ahabu akakota, “Ndi yani mweitumbula ngondo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Mlota akamuyangula, “Veve yati utumbula.”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Penapo nkosi Ahabu akavakemela manjolinjoli vasongolo vala pahi ya vakulu va wilaya, manjolinjoli miya hivili na selasini na vavili. Kangi akavakemela pamonga manjolinjoli voha vevasigalili, vakavya manjolinjoli elufu saba.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Manjolinjoli vasongolo vala vakawuka lukumbi lwa muhi, lukumbi Benihadadi pamonga na vankosi selasini na vavili vevawungini nayu pevavili mumandanda gavi vinywega na kugala. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Vakatumbula kuwuka manjolinjoli vasongolo vevalongoswayi na vakulu va wilaya. Lukumbi lwenulo Benihadadi atumili vajumbi kuhamba kung'omesa, na vene vakabwela kujova kuvya, “Manjolinjoli vibwela kuhumila ku Samalia.” <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Benihadadi akavajovela, “Muvakamulayi kuni vavii mumi changali kulola ngati vabwelili kwa uteke amala kwa ngondo.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Manjolinjoli vasongolo vavilongoswa na vakulu va wilaya, vahumili kuvala ya muji kuni manjolinjoli vibwela mumbele yavi. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Kila mumonga akamukoma likoko mweikomana nayu. Chenicho ndi chechakitili Vasilia vatilayi, kuni Vaisilaeli vakuvalandalila. Nambu Benihadadi nkosi wa ku Silia akatoloka kuni akwelili falasi waki pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki vevikwela falasi. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Nkosi wa ku Isilaeli akahotola ngondo, na kutola falasi na mutuka za ngondo za kuhutwa na falasi na kuvakoma manjolinjoli vamahele va ku Silia.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Kangi mlota akahamba kwa nkosi wa Isilaeli na kumjovela, “Ujitendekeha bwina na ukaholalelayi cha kukita, muni mwaka weubwela nkosi wa Silia yati ibwela kukuzangila kavili.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu va ku Silia vitovana kavili na Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Lukumbi lulalula, vakulu vevavii pahi ya nkosi Benihadadi vakamjovela naha, “Michapanga yavi ndi michapanga ya muhitumbi. Nambu tikatovana navu mumtambu, chakaka yati tikuvahotola. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Kita chenichi, vawusa vankosi selasini na vavili avo na vakoto kuvya vilongosi va manjolinjoli na pahala pavi vavika manjolinjoli vakekesi muni vavayimamila manjolinjoli voha. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Mewa yiganikiwa utendekehayi manjolinjoli vangi ngati vala vevakomiwi, na falasi ndava ya mutuka za ngondo, muni tihotolayi kutovana na Vaisilaeli ku mtambu, na lukumbi ulu yati tikuvahotola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:25">Nkosi Benihadadi akayidakila na akakita chenicho.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Mwaka wewalandili, lukumbi lwa mbepu, Benihadadi akavavika pamonga manjolinjoli vaki akahamba mbaka ku Afeka ndava ya kutovana na Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Vaisilaeli pevamalili kuvikwa pamonga na kupewa vindu vyavi vya ngondo, vakahamba kutovana na Vasilia. Vaisilaeli vawonakini ngati misambi idebe hidebe ya mene, nambu Vasilia vadandasiki pamulima woha.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Mlota wa Chapanga akahamba kwa nkosi Ahabu na kumjovela, “Bambu Chapanga ijova naha, ‘Ndava Vasilia vijova kuvya nene ndi Chapanga wa mu hitumbi, na lepi wa mu mitambu, yati nikukita uvahotola manjolinjoli ava vamahele, na veve yati umanya kuvya nene ndi Bambu Chapanga.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Mumagono saba vavikili kambi vilolesana, na ligono la saba yikatumbula ngondo. Vaisilaeli vakavakoma manjolinjoli va Vasilia laki yimonga kwa ligono limonga. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Vasilia vevasigalili vakajumbalila kumuji wa Afeka, luwumba lwa muji wenuwo lukavagwilila, na vandu elufu ishilini na saba vakafwa. Na mwene Benihadadi akajumbalila ku muji wuwowo wa Afeki na kujihiha mu chumba cha mugati.<verse eid="1KI 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Vatumisi vaki vakamuhambila na kumjovela kuvya, “Ndava muni vankosi va Isilaeli vana lipyana, tihambayi kwa nkosi wa Isilaeli kuni tiwalili nyula za magunila muviwunu vitu na kunyemba nyosi mu hingu. Pangi yati akukuleka mumi.” <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Vakawala magunila muhiwunu na nyosi kutindiha muhingu yavi ndi vakamuhambila nkosi wa Isilaeli na kujova, “Muhengaji waku Benihadadi ijova, ‘Chondi, niyupa unileka mumi.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Nkosi Ahabu akayangula, “Wu, akona avii mumi? Mwenuyu ndi mulongo wangu.”<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Vandu vala vakalitola linenu lila kuvya ulangisu wa uteke na vene vakaliyidakila linenu lila kanyata vakajova, “Ena, Benihadadi ndi mulongo waku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Nkosi Ahabu akavajovela, “Muhamba mukamuleta.” Benihadadi peabwelili, Ahabu akamkwesa mu mutuka yaki ya ngondo.<verse eid="1KI 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Ndi Benihadadi akajova “Yati nikuhiwuyisa miji yila yeahitolili dadi wangu mumawoko ga dadi waku. Uhotola kuvika pandu paku pa liguliyu ku Damesiki, ngati dadi wangu cheakitili ku Samalia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Ahabu akajova, “Ndava ya kuvikilana mapatanu ndi yati nikuleka mumi.” Ndi akavika mapatanu nayu, na akamuleka ahamba mumi.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlota akumpela likoto Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Kwa lilagizu la Bambu Chapanga, mlota mmonga pagati ya vamlota akamujovela muyaki, “Nitova kwa chindu chaku cha kutovanela ngondo,” Nambu mlota yula akabela. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Ndi mlota yula akajova, “Ndava wamuyidakili lepi Bambu Chapanga, lukumbi ndu petilekana yati uliwa na lihimba.”Na mundu yula peawukili, likamwangila lihimba likamukoma.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Mlota akamukolela mlota yungi na akamujovela, “Chondi nitova.” Mundu mwenuyo akamtova na kumulemasa. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Ndi mlota akahamba kuyima pamuhana ya njila kumulindalila nkosi. Akajing'anamusa kwa kuhelesa chitambala chaki cha kumutu mbaka pamihu muni akoto kumanyikana. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Nkosi peapitili penapo, mlota yula akamukemela na kumjovela, “Veve bambu, mtumisi waku nahambili ku ngondo na lukumbi ngondo peyatumbwili, mundu mumonga akanibwelela na mundu mweamukamwili akanijovela, ‘Muyunga mundu uyu. Ngati akakutolokayi yati ulipa wumi waki kwa wumi waku, amala hipandi elufu hidatu ya madini ga feza.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Nambu panahengayi mahengu gangi mundu yula akatila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Nkosi wa Isilaeli akamjovela, “Wenuwo ndi uhamula waku. Ujihamwili wamwene kwa malovi gaku.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Kangi mlota yula akajigubukula mihu gaki kanyata, na nkosi wa Isilaeli ndi akamumanya kuvya mumonga wa vamlota. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Mlota yula akamujovela nkosi, “Bambu Chapanga ijova naha, ‘Umulekili mumi mundu mwenaganili afwayi. Hinu wumi waki yati ukuulipa kwa wumi waku na wumi wa vandu vaki yati ukuulipa kwa wumi wa vandu vaku.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Nkosi wa Isilaeli akahamba ku nyumba yaki ya chinkosi ku Samalia kuni avii ngolongondi na ligoga.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Mgunda wa mizabibu wa Naboti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Naboti wa kumuji wa Yezileeli avili na mgunda wa mizabibu papipi na nyumba ya chinkosi ya Ahabu nkosi wa ku Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Ahabu akamujovela Naboti, “Nipela mgunda waku wa mizabibu niukita kuvya lidimba la makolo muni livi papipi na nyumba yangu ya chinkosi. Pahala paki yati nikukupela mgunda wungi wa mizabibu wabwina neju, amala ngati ugana yati nikukupela mashonga geuwona giganikiwa ndava ya mgunda waku.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Nambu Naboti akamuyangula, “Mgunda wenuwu nipatili kuhuma kwa vadadi vangu kuvya uhali wa nene, Bambu Chapanga anibesayi kukupela veve!”<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Penapo Ahabu akahamba munyumba kuni avii ngolongondi na ligoga ndava ya gala geayangwili Naboti mundu wa ku Yezileeli, geajovili, “Yati nikukupela lepi uhali wenipewili na vadadi vangu.” Akajigoneka panani ya chitanda chaki, na kung'anamukila ku luwumba pamihu na kubela kulya. <verse eid="1KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Yezebeli mdala waki akayingila mugati na akamukota, “Ndava ya kyani uvii ngolongondi naha? Na ndava kyani uganili lepi kulya?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Akamuyangula, “Ndava muni namujovili Naboti, wa ku Yezileeli, ‘Nigulisilayi mgunda waku wa mizabibu, amala ngati ugana yati nikukupela mgunda wungi wa mizabibu pahala paki.’ Nambu akajova, ‘Yati nikukupela lepi mgunda wangu wa mizabibu.’”<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Yezebeli mdala waki akajova, “Chenichi ndi cheukita, na veve ndi wankosi wa pa Isilaeli poha? Yinuka ulya! Sangalukayi. Yati nikukupela mgunda wa mizabibu wa Naboti mundu wa ku Yezileeli.”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Penapo Yezebeli mdala wa Ahabu akayandika balua kwa liina la Ahabu, akavika na minemu ya chinkosi panani ya balua zenizo, akazipeleka kwa vagogo na kwa vandu vevana cheu vevitama mu muji umonga na Naboti. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Mubalua zenizo ayandiki, “Mukokosayi ligono la kujiinisa kulya, muvakemela vandu pamonga na mukamtamika Naboti pandu pepana utopesa pagati ya vandu. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Nambu mumtamikayi na vandu vavili vahakahu vevakumkupakisila kuvya Naboti amuligili Chapanga na nkosi kangi atolewayi kuvala ya muji na mukambunayi kwa maganga afwayi.”<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Penapo vagogo na vandu vevana cheo vevatamili pamonga na Naboti pamuji wa Yezeleeli vakakita ngati Yezebeli chealagisi mubalua yeavayandikili. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Vakakokosa ligono la kujihinisa kulya, vakavakemela vandu pamonga na vakamutamika Naboti pandu pepana utopesa pagati ya vandu. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Kangi vandu vavili vahakahu vevakumkupakisila vakabwela kutama papipi nayu, na venavo vakaleta matakilu gahakahu kumvala Naboti palongolo ya vandu, vakajova, “Naboti amuligili Chapanga na nkosi.” Penapo vakamuhumisa kuvalaya muji vakamtova kwa maganga mbaka akafwa. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Kangi vakatuma ujumbi kwa Yezebeli, kujova, “Naboti abuniwi maganga mbaka afwili.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Bahopo Yezebeli peayuwini kuvya Naboti abuniwi maganga mbaka afwili, akamujovela Ahabu, “Naboti afwili! Yima uhamba ukautolayi mgunda wula wa mizabibu weabelili kukugulisila.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Ahabu peayuwini kuvya Naboti afwili, akayinuka na akahelela kuhamba kuutola mgunda wa mizabibu wa Naboti.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela mlota Eliya wa kuhuma ku Tishibi, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Helela ukakonganeka na Ahabu nkosi wa ku Isilaeli, mweitama ku Samalia, hinu avii mu mgunda wa mizabibu wa Naboti, weahambi kuutola. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Umujovela, ‘Bambu Chapanga ijova naha, Wu, umkomili lepi mundu na kutola vindu vyaki?’ Kangi umjovela, ‘Chenichi ndi cheijova Bambu Chapanga, Pandu mabwa pegalambili ngasi ya Naboti, ndi bahopo mabwa yati gilamba ngasi yaku.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Ahabu peamuwene Eliya ndi akamjovela, “Ndava yeniyo ndi unipatili veve mweuvii wa likoko vangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Eliya akayangula, “Ena! Nikupatili muni uhamwili wamwene kumbudila Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Hinu Bambu Chapanga ijova naha, ‘Yati nikukuletela mang'aiso na kukukomakesa veve na kila mgosi wa munyumba yaku akavya mvanda amala wa mundu mweangavya mvanda. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Yati nikuyikita nyumba yaku yivya ngati yila ya Yeloboamu mwana wa Nebati na yila ya Baasha mwana wa Ahiya, muni uniyomisi ndava muni ukiti Vaisilaeli vanibudila.’ <verse eid="1KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Kangi ndava ya Yezebeli, Bambu Chapanga ijova, ‘Mabwa yati gakumulya Yezebeli papipi na luwumba lwa Yezileeli.’ <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Mabwa yati gakumulya mundu yoyoha wa munyumba ya Ahabu mweifwilila kubomani, na vala vevifwilila kumigunda yati vidonyolewa na videge.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Katu pahumalili lepi na mundu mweabudili neju ngati Ahabu, mweahamwili kumbudila Bambu Chapanga, kwa kukulukiswa na Yezebeli mdala waki. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Akitili uhakahu neju kwa kufugamila michapanga ya vimong'omong'o, ngati Vaamoli. Vaamoli venava ndi vandu vevavingiwi na Bambu Chapanga pala Vaisilaeli pevahikili pa mulima wenuwo.<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Ahabu peayuwini genago, akapapula nyula zaki, akawala nyula za magunila na akajihinisa kulya. Akagona na akajigubika nyula za magunila, na kuhamba kuni na kula cha ungolongondi.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela mlota Eliya wa kuhuma ku Tishibi, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Ulolili Ahabu cheajivikili ngolongondi palongolo yangu? Ndava muni ajihelisi mwene, yati nileta lepi gahakahu aga lukumbi lweavii mumi, nambu yati nikugaleta lukumbi mwana waki peitalalilayi na kukomakesa vandu va munyumba yaki.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Mlota Mikaya akumlakalila Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">2 Lus 18:2-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Mulukumbi lwa miyaka hidatu kwavili lepi na ngondo pagati ya Silia na Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Nambu mumwaka wa datu Yehoshafati nkosi wa ku Yuda akahelela kuhamba kumulola Ahabu nkosi wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Nkosi wa Isilaeli akavakota vachilongosi vevavii pahi yaki, “Ndava kyani tikitili lepi chochoha ndava ya kuuwuyisa muji wa Lamoti Gileadi kuhuma kwa nkosi wa ku Silia?” <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Penapo akamukota Yehoshafati, “Wu, yati uhamba pamonga na nene kutovana na Lamoti Gileadi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Yehoshafati akamuyangula nkosi wa ku Isilaeli, “Nene ninamtahu lepi, muni nene ndi ngati veve na vandu vangu ndi ngati vandu vaku na falasi zangu ndi ngati falasi zaku.”<verse eid="1KI 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Yehoshafati akamujovela nkosi wa ku Isilaeli, “Mkota hoti Bambu Chapanga ijova kyani.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Penapo nkosi Ahabu wa Isilaeli akavaleta pamonga vamlota miya mcheche, akavakota, “Wu, nihambayi kungondo kutovana na Lamoti Gileadi, amala nikotoka kuhamba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Vakayangula, “Ena, hamba ndava muni Chapanga yati akukukita uvahotolayi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Nambu Yehoshafati akakota, “Wu, avii lepi mlota yungi wa Bambu Chapanga peapa mwetihotola kumukota?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Nkosi wa Isilaeli akamuyangula Yehoshafati, “Akona avii mundu mumonga mwetihotola kumkota kumvala Bambu Chapanga, nambu nimvengili muni ilotela lepi gabwina kunivala nene, nambu magono goha akunilotela gahakahu ndu. Mundu mwene ndi Mikaya mwana wa Imla.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Yehoshafati akayangula, “Chabwina lepi nkosi kujova chenichi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Penapo Ahabu nkosi wa ku Isilaeli akamukemela mumonga pagati ya vakulu vevavii pahi yaki akamujovela, “Mleta kanyata Mikaya mwana waki Imla.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Nkosi wa ku Isilaeli pamonga na Yehoshafati nkosi wa ku Yuda vawalili nyula zavi za chinkosi, na kutama muvigoda vyavi vya chinkosi pa luvanja lwa kubulila mabenu, palimulyangu la kuyingilila mu Samalia, vamlota voha vavili pamonga na vene, <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Sedekia mwana wa Kenaana, atenganizi mang'elu ga lyuma, akakokosa naha, “Chenichi ndi cheijova Bambu Chapanga, ‘Kwa mang'elu aga yati ukuvamula Vasilia mbaka vayongomeswa njee.’” <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Vamlota vangi voha valotelayi chichocho vajovayi, “Hamba ukayibuna Lamoti Gileadi, ndava muni Bambu Chapanga yati akukukita uvahotola.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Muhengaji mweahambili kumukemela Mikaya akamujovela, “Lola, vamlota voha vavii ngati mundu mumonga vilotela uhotola kwa nkosi. Na veve ulotelayi uhotola ngati vayaku, na veve ujova gabwina kumvala nkosi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Nambu Mikaya akayangula, “Chakaka nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga, yati nikumujovela chila ndu cheakunijovela Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Mikaya peahikili palongolo ya nkosi, nkosi akamukota, “Wu, tihamba kungondo kukomana na Lamoti Gileadi amala tikoto kuhamba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Akamuyangula, “Hamba katovana yati uhotola, muni Bambu Chapanga yati akukupela uhotola.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Nambu nkosi Ahabu akamujovela Mikaya, “Wu, nikulapisayi mala zilinga peulongela na nene kumvala Bambu Chapanga ulongelayi ga chakaka ndu?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Penapo Mikaya akamuyangula, “Nivaweni Vaisilaeli voha vadandasiki kuhitumbi ngati mambelele gangali mundu wa kugadima, na mwene Bambu Chapanga akajova, ‘Vandu ava vana bambu lepi. Muleka kila mumonga ahamba kunyumba yaki cha uteke.’”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Ahabu nkosi wa ku Isilaeli akamujovela Yehoshafati, “Nakujovili lepi kuvya yati ilotela lepi chindu chochoha chabwina kunivala nene? Lukumbi lwoha ilotela gahakahu ndu!”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Mikaya akayendelela kujova, “Hinu yuwanilayi cheijova Bambu Chapanga! Namuweni Bambu Chapanga atamili pa chigoda chaki cha unkosi kunani kwaki pamonga na vahengaji vaki voha vayimili kumtindila upandi wa kulyela na upandi wa kumangiha. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Bambu Chapanga akakota, ‘Yani yati akumukonga Ahabu ahamba kukomana na Lamothi Gileadi na kuhamba kufwila kwenuko?’ Mmonga akajova naha na yungi akajova naha. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Hinu mzuka umonga ukayima palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga na kujova, ‘Yati nikumukonga.’” <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Bambu Chapanga akaukota, “Yati ukita wuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">Ukayangula, “Yati nihamba na kujikita mpungu wa udesi na kuvakita vamlota va Ahabu valongela udesi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">Bambu Chapanga akaujovela, “Yati uhotola kumkonga, hamba ukakita chenicho.”<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />Na Mikaya akamalakisa kwa kujova, “Ndava yeniyo Bambu Chapanga avakitili vamlota vaku valongela udesi. Na mwene Bambu Chapanga ajovili gahakahu gegakukolelayi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Pena Sedekia mwana wa Kenaana akahamba kumbamanda Mikaya likofi la kumihu. Na kumkota, “Tangia ndali Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga unilekili nene na kubwela na kubwela kulongela na veve?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya akayangula, “Yati umanya ligono lila leuhamba kujihiha muchumba cha mugati.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Kangi Ahabu nkosi wa Isilaeli akalagisa, “Mumkamula Mikaya na mumpeleka kwa Amoni mtalalila wa muji na kwa Yoashi mwana waki nkosi Ahabu. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Mukavajovela vamvika mundu uyu muchifungu na mukotoka kumupela chindu chochoha neju ya libumunda na manji ndu mbaka peniwuya nivii mumi kuhuma ku ngondo.”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Mikaya akajova, “Ngati yati ukawuya mumi cha uteke, manya Bambu Chapanga ajovili lepi na nene.” Kangi akayonjokesa kujova, “Mwavandu voha, mwiganikiwa muniyuwanila chenijova!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahabu ifwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2 Lus 18:28-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Ndi Ahabu nkosi wa Isilaeli na Yehoshafati nkosi wa ku Yuda vakahamba kuuzangila muji wa ku Lamoti Gileadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Nkosi wa ku Isilaeli akamujovela Yehoshafati nkosi wa ku Yuda, “Yati niyingila mu ngondo kuni nangawala nyula za chinkosi, nambu veve walayi nyula zaku za chinkosi.” Ndi nkosi wa ku Isilaeli akajing'anamusa kwa kuwala nyula zingi ndi vakahamba kungondo.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Lukumbi lwenulo, nkosi wa ku Silia avalagisi vakekesi selasini na vavili veviyimamila mutuka za ngondo, “Mkotoka kukomana na mdebe amala mvaha nambu nga nkosi wa ku Isilaeli.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Vakekesi va mutuka za ngondo lukumbi pevamuweni Yehoshafati vakaholalela, “Chakaka mwenuyu ndi nkosi wa Isilaeli,” Ndi vakang'anamuka muni vamukoma, nambu Yehoshafati peakwesili lwami. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Vala vakekesiselasini na mbili ndi vakamanya kuvyamwenuyu nkosi lepi wa ku Isilaeli, ndi vakaleka kumlandalila. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Nambu linjolinjoli mmonga wa ku Silia akahuta nduta yaki changali kumanya akumutova yani ndi akamubuna nkosi wa Isilaeli palutotelu lwa magwanda gaki ga lyuma. Nkosi Ahabu akamujovela mweigendesa mutuka yaki, “Ng'anamusa mutuka na uniwusa nene pangondo muni nilemili.”<verse eid="1KI 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Ngondo yikayendelela muhi woha, na mwene nkosi Ahabu vakamgoneka mu mutuka yaki ya kuhutwa na falasi. Ngasi yikayendelela kuchuluzika pandu pala pealemili pachilonda chaki yikahululila mugati ya mutuka yaki, peyahikili chimihi akafwa. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Lilanga pelatumbwili kutipama, ukokoso ukadandasika mu manjolinjoli voha kujova, “Kila mundu ahamba kubomani kwaki, na kila munda ahamba ku mlima waki!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Ndi nkosi Ahabu akafwa na vakamuleta ku Samalia na vakamzika kwenuiko. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Vakayisanja mutuka ya kuhutwa na falasi vakalisanja munyanja Samalia, pandu pevasambayi vakemi. Na mabwa gakamyanga ngasi yaki, ngati linenu la Bambu Chapanga chelajovili.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Matendu gangi geagakitili nkosi Ahabu, pamonga na nyumba ya chinkosi yeajengili na kuyinyambisa kwa mang'elu ga ndembu na miji yoha yeayijengili, vyenivyo vyoha vyayandikwi mu Chitabu cha ukumbuso wa Vankosi va Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Nkosi Ahabu peafwili, Ahazia mwana waki akavya nkosi pahala paki.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati nkosi wa ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">2 Lus 20:31-21:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Yehoshafati mwana wa Asa akavya nkosi wa ku Yuda mumwaka wa mcheche wa utalalila wa Ahabu nkosi wa ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehoshafati peatubwili kutalalila avili na ntanga ya miyaka selasini na muhanu, na mwene akatalalila ku Yelusalemu kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka isilini na muhanu. Nyinawaki akemiwa Azuba msikana wa Shilihi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Akitili gabwina kwa Bambu Chapnga ngati chaakitili Asa dadi waki. Akitili gegavii gabwina kwa Bambu Chapanga. Pamonga na naha abomwili lepi pandu pa panani pa kuyupila, hinu vandu vayendalili kuteta na kuhukisa ubani. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Mewa Yehoshafati akatama chauteke na nkosi Ahabu wa ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Matendu goha geakitili Yehoshafati, na ukekesi waki mungondo, gayandikwi Muchitabu cha Ukumbuso wa vankosi va ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Avavingili vagosi na vadala voha vevakitayi ukemi Pandu pa kunani pa kutetela michapanga, vevasigalili tangia tangu magono ga Asa dadi waki.<verse eid="1KI 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Tangia penapo kwavili lepi na nkosi pa Edomu, mlima watalaliwi na mundu mweahaguliwi na nkosi wa ku Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Lukumbi lwenulo nkosi Yehoshafati atendakihi watu zamahele za kugulila muni ahamba ku Ofili kutola zahabu, nambu katu zahambili lepi muni zadenyekili ku Esioni Gebeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Lukumbi lula Ahazia mwana wa Ahabu akamujovela Yehoshafati, “Valeka vandu vangu vagenda pamonga na vandu vaku muwatu,” Nambu Yehoshafati akabela.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Pena Yehoshafati akafwa na akazikwa pevazikwi pa muji wa Daudi. Na Yeholamu mwana wakiakvya nkosi pahala paki.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahazia nkosi wa ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Mumwaka wa kumi na saba wa Yehoshafati nkosi wa Yuda, Ahazia mwana wa Ahabu akavya nkosi wa ku Isilaeli kuni itama ku Samalia, na mwene akatalalila pa Samalia mu miyaka hivili. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Ahazia ambudili Bambu Chapanga muni akitili uhakau ngati cheakitili dadi waki na nyina waki na gala geakitili Yeloboamu mwana wa Nebati, mweavakitili vandu va ku Isilaeli vamubudila Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Ahazia amufugamili mchapanga Baali na kumuyomesa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli. Akitili ngati chila cheakitili Ahabu dadi waki.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>